asr-000388
00:46:41.260 --> 00:46:45.600
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: as Vice Chairman of Subcommittee J of the Committee on Finance,

asr-000389
00:46:45.760 --> 00:46:49.880
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: it is my privilege to sponsor the proposed budget of the Commission on Elections

asr-000390
00:46:49.880 --> 00:46:59.980
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: for fiscal year 2027, amounting to 29,163,661,000 pesos.

asr-000391
00:47:00.000 --> 00:47:05.120
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: This represents an increase of 2,000,000 pesos in capital outlay

asr-000392
00:47:05.120 --> 00:47:08.280
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: over the amount proposed under the National Expenditure Program,

asr-000393
00:47:09.000 --> 00:47:12.740
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: which was retained and adopted in the House General Appropriations Bill,

asr-000394
00:47:13.660 --> 00:47:19.440
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: which stood at 29,161,661,000 pesos.

asr-000395
00:47:19.860 --> 00:47:21.920
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Of the additional allocation, Mr. President,

asr-000396
00:47:22.120 --> 00:47:29.060
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 1,000,000 is to augment funds for the construction of the Comelec Integrated Field Office buildings,

asr-000397
00:47:29.060 --> 00:47:29.960
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: while the...

asr-000398
00:47:30.000 --> 00:47:34.740
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: either 1,000,000 is allotted or allocated as additional funding

asr-000399
00:47:34.740 --> 00:47:37.920
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: for the construction of the new Comelec building.

asr-000400
00:47:38.700 --> 00:47:41.100
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: The new appropriations will be broken down as follows.

asr-000401
00:47:42.200 --> 00:47:48.100
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 5,105,751,000 pesos for personal services,

asr-000402
00:47:48.920 --> 00:47:55.220
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 24,055,910,000 pesos for MOOE,

asr-000403
00:47:55.220 --> 00:47:59.280
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: and 2,000,000 pesos for capital outlay.

asr-000404
00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:01.860
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Mr. President, our colleagues may be wondering

asr-000405
00:48:01.860 --> 00:48:03.700
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: what 2, 1,000,000 pesos

asr-000406
00:48:03.700 --> 00:48:09.280
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: for A, construction of the new Comelec building,

asr-000407
00:48:09.560 --> 00:48:13.620
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: and B, construction of the Comelec Integrated Field Office buildings

asr-000408
00:48:13.620 --> 00:48:17.200
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: do or contribute to the described line items.

asr-000409
00:48:17.320 --> 00:48:19.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Let me explain, Mr. President, very briefly.

asr-000410
00:48:20.000 --> 00:48:21.880
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: The agency, through the good Comelec chairman,

asr-000411
00:48:22.160 --> 00:48:25.400
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: is fully mindful of the tight fiscal space

asr-000412
00:48:25.400 --> 00:48:29.000
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: even going to the following year, 2027,

asr-000413
00:48:29.000 --> 00:48:32.440
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: exacerbated by a bad economic outlook.

asr-000414
00:48:32.740 --> 00:48:36.640
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: That's why we are putting in nominal amounts of 1,000,000 each.

asr-000415
00:48:37.400 --> 00:48:39.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So the Comelec, through the chairman,

asr-000416
00:48:39.580 --> 00:48:41.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: being a constitutional body,

asr-000417
00:48:41.160 --> 00:48:45.580
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: may be authorized to realign, to augment from savings

asr-000418
00:48:45.580 --> 00:48:50.400
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: or any available appropriations in future budget measures,

asr-000419
00:48:50.740 --> 00:48:53.900
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: which we cannot do unless there is a line item.

asr-000420
00:48:54.440 --> 00:48:56.220
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: In short, Mr. President, and his colleagues,

asr-000421
00:48:57.080 --> 00:48:58.960
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: In short, Mr. President, colleagues,

asr-000422
00:48:59.000 --> 00:49:22.940
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Gusto lamang po ni Chairman Garcia na magkaroon ng bahay kasi pag wala hong line item, wala siyang paglalagyan. He cannot be authorized to realign or augment. And that is very clear in the Constitution. Having said that, Mr. President, your subcommittee is now ready to accept questions and other points of clarification that our colleagues may wish to ask. Thank you.

