asr-000858
01:24:39.840 --> 01:24:47.840
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: We do not want palakasan or irregularity in the implementation, which was uncovered many, many years ago.

asr-000859
01:24:47.840 --> 01:24:49.840
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Yes.

