asr-000862
01:25:01.840 --> 01:25:05.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: given that they are now completely digitalized.

asr-000863
01:25:05.840 --> 01:25:07.840
Senator Vicente C. Sotto III: Very good. Thank you very much.

