asr-001130
01:37:57.220 --> 01:38:03.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: big commercial fishing vessels, nang sagay hindi sila makipag-compete sa mga municipal fisher folks.

asr-001131
01:38:03.260 --> 01:38:10.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So nag-file ng case sa Supreme Court, itong malilit na fisher folks.

asr-001132
01:38:10.700 --> 01:38:22.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And na-dismiss ng Supreme Court dahil na-technical sapagkat hindi nakapag-file on time ng sagot itong OSG.

asr-001133
01:38:22.700 --> 01:38:23.500
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Why?

asr-001134
01:38:30.220 --> 01:38:33.700
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, merong...

asr-001135
01:38:33.700 --> 01:38:40.700
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: According to the Solgen, Mr. President, there was an issue on the...

asr-001136
01:38:40.700 --> 01:38:52.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: prescriptive period that the lower court did not appreciate, and that's why na-dismiss on a technicality.

asr-001137
01:38:52.240 --> 01:38:52.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: No?

asr-001138
01:38:57.960 --> 01:39:06.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And when the Supreme Court ruled on that technicality, the Solgen filed a motion for reconsideration.

asr-001139
01:39:06.700 --> 01:39:09.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, there was a...

asr-001140
01:39:09.240 --> 01:39:10.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: There was a...

asr-001141
01:39:10.700 --> 01:39:17.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: controversy, if you can call it that, legal controversy sa lower left, sa RTC.

asr-001142
01:39:18.280 --> 01:39:28.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The RTC judge then, who I understand has since retired, did not, at least the contention of the Solgen's office,

asr-001143
01:39:28.420 --> 01:39:40.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: is that certain rules were disregarded or not followed, and therefore, the lower court said,

asr-001144
01:39:40.320 --> 01:39:42.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: you filed it out of time.

asr-001145
01:39:43.220 --> 01:39:48.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But the Solgen then believed the position of the Solgen was...

asr-001146
01:39:48.820 --> 01:39:50.660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: that was not proper.

asr-001147
01:39:51.520 --> 01:40:01.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Therefore, the Supreme Court ruled in favor of the RTC, and then a motion for reconsideration.

asr-001148
01:40:01.360 --> 01:40:01.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Correct.

asr-001149
01:40:02.080 --> 01:40:04.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dahil nga na-delay yung pag-file na kaligtaan.

asr-001150
01:40:04.920 --> 01:40:08.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, meron kasi mga nagsabi na...

asr-001151
01:40:10.320 --> 01:40:18.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: O, taga-OSG, sinadya na i-delay yung pag-file ng sagot sa Supreme Court, kaya na-dismiss.

asr-001152
01:40:18.460 --> 01:40:25.160
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At bakit na sinadya ma-delay dahil nakipag-friendship daw sa mga malalaking commercial fishing vessels?

asr-001153
01:40:27.980 --> 01:40:28.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-001154
01:40:30.560 --> 01:40:35.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, this case was in 2023.

asr-001155
01:40:35.520 --> 01:40:36.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: That is correct.

asr-001156
01:40:36.000 --> 01:40:40.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But my own appreciation, based on the...

asr-001157
01:40:40.320 --> 01:40:42.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: records, is medyo question...

asr-001158
01:40:42.900 --> 01:40:44.700
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: This is at least my view as a lawyer.

asr-001159
01:40:45.280 --> 01:40:55.700
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Medyo questionable yung naging ruling ng RTC, actually, in terms of the period within which they could file an appeal.

asr-001160
01:40:56.040 --> 01:40:57.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 15 days, I think, I believe.

asr-001161
01:40:57.620 --> 01:40:57.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yes.

asr-001162
01:40:58.160 --> 01:40:58.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: They have...

asr-001163
01:40:58.860 --> 01:41:00.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The reckoning, I think, there was a...

asr-001164
01:41:00.880 --> 01:41:06.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Based on the records, the reckoning period was so.

asr-001165
01:41:06.920 --> 01:41:09.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero parang hindi ito...

asr-001166
01:41:10.320 --> 01:41:14.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Nirecognize nung RTC, based on the records, kaya na-dismiss yung kaso.

asr-001167
01:41:15.560 --> 01:41:19.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And then, umabot sa Supreme Court.

asr-001168
01:41:19.200 --> 01:41:22.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But right now nga, meron ng pending motion for reconsideration.

asr-001169
01:41:22.300 --> 01:41:31.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero hindi man lang pinarusahan ang OSG, yung kanilang personel, na naging dahilan para ma-delay yung pag-file ng motion?

asr-001170
01:41:32.440 --> 01:41:32.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ng answer?

asr-001171
01:41:34.200 --> 01:41:39.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi, para naman yung mga small fisher folks natin, mapanatang kalooban dahil sabi nila,

asr-001172
01:41:39.620 --> 01:41:42.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: palibasa malilit kami, wala kaming panlagay, wala kaming pang-PR.

asr-001173
01:41:43.520 --> 01:41:47.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Itong mga malalaking commercial fishing vessels may pang-PR, nanuhul.

asr-001174
01:41:48.560 --> 01:41:50.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I mean, pasintabi.

asr-001175
01:41:50.940 --> 01:41:55.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya nga, sinadyak ngayon ng OSG na i-delay yung pag-file ng sagot.

asr-001176
01:41:56.040 --> 01:42:01.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So yun na siguro, para naman ano, kailangan siguro maparusahan o maano man lang,

asr-001177
01:42:01.700 --> 01:42:07.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: mabigyan ng memo kung sino man yung sa OSG na naging reason para naging delay yung pag-sagot.

asr-001178
01:42:07.100 --> 01:42:09.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, I understand the concern of the good senator.

asr-001179
01:42:09.620 --> 01:42:14.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In fact, we are hearing this, we are still hearing this in the Committee on Agriculture.

asr-001180
01:42:14.840 --> 01:42:15.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001181
01:42:15.840 --> 01:42:19.440
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the good senator attended, as well as Senator Erwin.

asr-001182
01:42:20.140 --> 01:42:24.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But my appreciation of the documents when it was presented to me,

asr-001183
01:42:24.760 --> 01:42:29.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: was that kung merong, of course there is no evidence, we don't have the evidence,

asr-001184
01:42:30.660 --> 01:42:35.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: but it's speculative, but having said that, just to qualify,

asr-001185
01:42:36.540 --> 01:42:39.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: parang kung merong nasuhulan, hindi yung soldier,

asr-001186
01:42:39.620 --> 01:42:42.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kung hindi yung RTC.

asr-001187
01:42:43.480 --> 01:42:52.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Dahil binasa ko yung records, iba yung interpretation ng RTC judge,

asr-001188
01:42:52.140 --> 01:43:00.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: dun sa interpretation ng soldier, only precisely the technicality of the time within which they could file a motion for...

asr-001189
01:43:01.180 --> 01:43:01.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Reconservation.

asr-001190
01:43:03.600 --> 01:43:05.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, yes. That is my understanding.

asr-001191
01:43:05.760 --> 01:43:07.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Dami nang binasa ko.

asr-001192
01:43:08.140 --> 01:43:09.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Mga binabasa kong dokumento.

asr-001193
01:43:09.620 --> 01:43:11.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Hindi ko na maalala masyado.

asr-001194
01:43:11.180 --> 01:43:16.360
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But yun ang immediate reaction ko, bakit ginawa ito ng RTC?

asr-001195
01:43:16.860 --> 01:43:25.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But having said that, the soldier is of the view that precisely they did not investigate

asr-001196
01:43:26.260 --> 01:43:35.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: because the issue for them was a conflict in the interpretation of the law,

asr-001197
01:43:35.620 --> 01:43:38.620
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: rather than culpability.

asr-001198
01:43:39.620 --> 01:43:42.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: A probable violation of any individual.

asr-001199
01:43:43.900 --> 01:43:44.500
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay, good.

asr-001200
01:43:45.120 --> 01:43:50.020
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Correct me if I'm wrong, sulod-sulod ang talo ng kaso ng BIFAR sa Supreme Court.

asr-001201
01:43:51.280 --> 01:43:53.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And anong ginagawa ng soldier?

asr-001202
01:43:54.120 --> 01:43:59.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bakit palaging talunan ang ating mga taga-BIFAR sa mga kaso?

asr-001203
01:43:59.240 --> 01:44:04.020
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero before going to that, last na naman pala dun sa Mercedar case, anong pinaka-status?

asr-001204
01:44:05.220 --> 01:44:07.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It's still with the Supreme Court.

asr-001205
01:44:07.040 --> 01:44:09.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It's pending ang motion for reconsideration.

asr-001206
01:44:09.620 --> 01:44:14.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So it's really, right now, the ball is in the court of the Supreme.

asr-001207
01:44:14.600 --> 01:44:17.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The ball is in the Supreme Court's court.

asr-001208
01:44:17.640 --> 01:44:17.880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001209
01:44:19.640 --> 01:44:21.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Now, let's go to BIFAR.

asr-001210
01:44:23.940 --> 01:44:32.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sulod-sulod natin ang pagkatalo ng mga kaso ng BIFAR sa pagdating Supreme Court,

asr-001211
01:44:32.680 --> 01:44:35.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: particularly dun sa paggamit ng vessel monitoring system.

asr-001212
01:44:36.840 --> 01:44:38.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bakit palaging natatalo yung BIFAR?

asr-001213
01:44:38.680 --> 01:44:39.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mahina ba yung...

asr-001214
01:44:39.620 --> 01:44:57.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, the Solicitor General's office is likewise unhappy with the ruling of the Supreme Court.

asr-001215
01:44:57.760 --> 01:44:59.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: This representation as well.

asr-001216
01:45:00.000 --> 01:45:04.360
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and therefore, they did file a motion for reconsideration.

asr-001217
01:45:05.280 --> 01:45:12.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, last na lamang, anong reason bakit natalo yung before doon sa vessel monitoring system?

asr-001218
01:45:12.140 --> 01:45:16.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, technical ulit dahil hindi nakapag-motion for reconsideration on time?

asr-001219
01:45:18.280 --> 01:45:20.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: No, this is a ruling on the merits.

asr-001220
01:45:21.380 --> 01:45:21.860
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: On the merits.

asr-001221
01:45:21.940 --> 01:45:23.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, it's not a technicality.

asr-001222
01:45:23.660 --> 01:45:23.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-001223
01:45:23.920 --> 01:45:34.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: If I recall correctly, very vague, I can recall quite, not exactly the wording,

asr-001224
01:45:34.600 --> 01:45:47.960
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: but they were saying that it was a violation of the trade secrets of these commercial fishing vessels.

asr-001225
01:45:49.460 --> 01:45:52.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And that meron din privacy.

asr-001226
01:45:52.220 --> 01:45:53.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And then it wasn't.

asr-001227
01:45:53.920 --> 01:45:54.020
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001228
01:45:58.140 --> 01:45:58.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-001229
01:45:58.900 --> 01:46:05.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, they did favor the commercial fishing vessels petition.

asr-001230
01:46:05.700 --> 01:46:08.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And that's why there is now a motion for reconsideration.

asr-001231
01:46:09.420 --> 01:46:09.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001232
01:46:09.680 --> 01:46:10.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, yan pinaka-status ngayon.

asr-001233
01:46:11.080 --> 01:46:13.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron motion for reconsideration pending ngayon sa Supreme Court.

asr-001234
01:46:14.280 --> 01:46:15.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And we are in the Senate.

asr-001235
01:46:16.180 --> 01:46:19.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At least your Committee on Agriculture, sir, is monitoring this

asr-001236
01:46:19.820 --> 01:46:23.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: because we are likewise interested in the final outcome

asr-001237
01:46:23.020 --> 01:46:23.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: because we feel that this is a very important issue.

asr-001238
01:46:23.900 --> 01:46:28.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And at the moment, Mr. President, if I may add,

asr-001239
01:46:28.960 --> 01:46:33.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: your Committee on Agriculture likewise would like to inform you

asr-001240
01:46:33.720 --> 01:46:39.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: that we are revisiting the Fisheries Code

asr-001241
01:46:39.260 --> 01:46:42.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and introducing proposed amendments.

asr-001242
01:46:42.720 --> 01:46:48.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: The Committee report will be out perhaps after the budget debates

asr-001243
01:46:48.140 --> 01:46:53.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: so that we can strengthen how we can protect our marginal resources.

asr-001244
01:46:53.880 --> 01:46:58.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-001245
01:46:58.100 --> 01:46:59.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-001246
01:46:59.260 --> 01:47:01.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Now, let's move on sa Bucor.

asr-001247
01:47:02.600 --> 01:47:02.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001248
01:47:03.400 --> 01:47:05.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Recently, in the past few months,

asr-001249
01:47:06.620 --> 01:47:10.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: sunod-sunod yung pagpupunta sa akin ng mga PDL na kalalaya lang

asr-001250
01:47:10.460 --> 01:47:15.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: after 20 years or 30 years nag-serve sa penitentiary.

asr-001251
01:47:16.240 --> 01:47:18.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And wala man lang binigay sa kanilang pampamasahe.

asr-001252
01:47:20.100 --> 01:47:20.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Walang-wala.

asr-001253
01:47:21.000 --> 01:47:22.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Zero yung sila.

asr-001254
01:47:22.200 --> 01:47:23.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: They don't know what to do.

asr-001255
01:47:23.140 --> 01:47:28.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi kung ganun ang treatment natin sa mga napalaya natin ng mga PDL

asr-001256
01:47:28.280 --> 01:47:29.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: after so many years,

asr-001257
01:47:30.000 --> 01:47:32.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: eh baka bumalik sila ulit sa masamang gawain

asr-001258
01:47:32.140 --> 01:47:32.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: kasi walang-wala.

asr-001259
01:47:33.000 --> 01:47:36.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala ba tayong mga halfway houses tulad sa ibang bansa

asr-001260
01:47:36.760 --> 01:47:40.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: para tinutulungan sila?

asr-001261
01:47:41.860 --> 01:47:44.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then, correct me if I'm wrong,

asr-001262
01:47:44.740 --> 01:47:47.740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: dati ata meron tayong tinatawag or sa ibang bansa kuwata na mga ito.

asr-001263
01:47:48.020 --> 01:47:51.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yung bawat PDL, habang nasa loob sila,

asr-001264
01:47:51.220 --> 01:47:52.200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: meron silang sweldo.

asr-001265
01:47:52.200 --> 01:47:54.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Doon sa pagtatrabaho nila sa loob,

asr-001266
01:47:54.140 --> 01:47:56.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: regardless kung anong klaseng trabaho binibigay sa kanila,

asr-001267
01:47:56.360 --> 01:47:58.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: like one peso or one dollar per day.

asr-001268
01:47:59.020 --> 01:48:02.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So if you compute that for 20 years na kapag silbi sila,

asr-001269
01:48:02.420 --> 01:48:05.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: paglabas sila, meron silang 7,000 US dollars or something pesos.

asr-001270
01:48:05.720 --> 01:48:07.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron silang 7,000 something pesos.

asr-001271
01:48:07.740 --> 01:48:11.160
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So hindi sila lumabas ng walang-wala

asr-001272
01:48:11.160 --> 01:48:16.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at maghahanap ulit ng diskarte racket para magkaroon ng konting pera.

asr-001273
01:48:17.260 --> 01:48:20.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi maraming beses pupunta, Mr. President, sa akin yung mga PDL.

asr-001274
01:48:20.640 --> 01:48:21.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Of course, hindi ako nagreklamo.

asr-001275
01:48:22.200 --> 01:48:23.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tutuwa nga ako sa tiwala nila.

asr-001276
01:48:23.620 --> 01:48:25.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya lang, pupunta sa programo ko sa Wanted sa radyo.

asr-001277
01:48:26.260 --> 01:48:29.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala man lang ni Pamasahe na binigay.

asr-001278
01:48:30.480 --> 01:48:34.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, according to the BUCOR, Mr. President,

asr-001279
01:48:34.420 --> 01:48:38.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: they actually have a budget for transportation and gratuity, number one.

asr-001280
01:48:39.340 --> 01:48:46.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And number two, there is a program within the facility with the institution

asr-001281
01:48:46.420 --> 01:48:51.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: wherein when they do manual labor, they are actually given salary

asr-001282
01:48:52.200 --> 01:48:54.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: and that these are all on record.

asr-001283
01:48:55.260 --> 01:48:59.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So may nagbubulsa kasi hindi nakakarating sa kanila.

asr-001284
01:49:00.320 --> 01:49:02.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: May nagbubulsa. Sino yung nagbubulsa doon?

asr-001285
01:49:03.380 --> 01:49:09.700
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, the good secretary is willing to verify and validate.

asr-001286
01:49:09.820 --> 01:49:10.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, please.

asr-001287
01:49:10.620 --> 01:49:13.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, so that this can be checked.

asr-001288
01:49:14.680 --> 01:49:18.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And so if the information can be relayed to them,

asr-001289
01:49:18.160 --> 01:49:21.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: then they can validate.

asr-001290
01:49:22.200 --> 01:49:29.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And the department secretary says they will not tolerate this malpractice.

asr-001291
01:49:29.640 --> 01:49:33.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So I'm sure mayroon talaga nagbubulsa dyan na dapat mapunta sa mga PDL,

asr-001292
01:49:33.740 --> 01:49:37.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: binubulsa, hindi nila naawa, na konsensya na baka yung PDL na yan

asr-001293
01:49:37.260 --> 01:49:41.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: babalik ulit sa crime dahil kailangan nila magkaroon ng pera.

asr-001294
01:49:41.820 --> 01:49:46.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Matanong ko lang, wala tayong mga safe houses, I mean halfway houses

asr-001295
01:49:46.340 --> 01:49:49.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: para sa mga PDL, mayroon?

asr-001296
01:49:51.120 --> 01:49:52.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Doon, tinitrain sila.

asr-001297
01:49:52.200 --> 01:49:57.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tinitrain sila, yung post-release rehab, mayroon?

asr-001298
01:49:57.780 --> 01:50:01.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: According to the Bucor, they do have safe houses.

asr-001299
01:50:01.480 --> 01:50:02.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung mga...

asr-001300
01:50:02.860 --> 01:50:03.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sorry.

asr-001301
01:50:03.660 --> 01:50:04.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Halfway houses.

asr-001303
01:50:06.220 --> 01:50:08.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Halfway houses, post-release.

asr-001304
01:50:09.020 --> 01:50:17.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kapag sila ay na-release na at wala silang uuwi ang mga residente, residential area, may halfway homes.

asr-001305
01:50:17.200 --> 01:50:18.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I don't think so. Sorry.

asr-001306
01:50:18.140 --> 01:50:20.880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero I don't think so.

asr-001307
01:50:21.080 --> 01:50:21.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala. Zero.

asr-001308
01:50:22.200 --> 01:50:23.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Zero talaga.

asr-001309
01:50:25.260 --> 01:50:27.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala eh, wala. Wala, wala, wala.

asr-001310
01:50:29.020 --> 01:50:32.160
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi kung meron, di sinabi na sa akin ng mga PDL na na-release.

asr-001311
01:50:32.240 --> 01:50:32.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Sa Bucor.

asr-001312
01:50:34.380 --> 01:50:39.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Well, according to Bucor, the halfway homes are in Bucor itself.

asr-001313
01:50:40.000 --> 01:50:45.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So habang hindi sila sinusundo ng kanilang mga kamag-anakan, nandun sila sa Bucor.

asr-001314
01:50:45.000 --> 01:50:49.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: No, dapat yung halfway houses sa labas para reintegrate sila sa society

asr-001315
01:50:49.920 --> 01:50:51.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at tinuturuan sila ng mga...

asr-001316
01:50:52.200 --> 01:50:59.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: bagay-bagay na kung paano sila makapag-adjust because they've been inside the Muntinlupa for 20, 30 years.

asr-001317
01:50:59.560 --> 01:51:02.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maninibago sila kung basta-basta muna lang agad isarpak sila sa labas.

asr-001318
01:51:03.180 --> 01:51:03.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Diba?

asr-001319
01:51:04.640 --> 01:51:07.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes. So wala po silang halfway house sa labas.

asr-001320
01:51:08.400 --> 01:51:09.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat meron sa labas.

asr-001321
01:51:09.000 --> 01:51:09.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala pong budget.

asr-001322
01:51:10.420 --> 01:51:10.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So...

asr-001323
01:51:10.460 --> 01:51:11.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Edihingan natin ang budget.

asr-001324
01:51:11.880 --> 01:51:13.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ayun. So...

asr-001325
01:51:13.240 --> 01:51:14.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Diba?

asr-001326
01:51:14.260 --> 01:51:16.700
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So they are asking for the help of the good senator.

asr-001327
01:51:16.700 --> 01:51:21.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron pa tayong mga data na yung mga lumaya bumalik ulit dahil napabayaan.

asr-001328
01:51:22.200 --> 01:51:23.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Diba sila ng ating pamalaan?

asr-001329
01:51:23.960 --> 01:51:24.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi silang bigyan ng support?

asr-001330
01:51:25.340 --> 01:51:26.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala kayong data noon?

asr-001331
01:51:26.820 --> 01:51:27.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung managing recidivist?

asr-001332
01:51:29.340 --> 01:51:37.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ang data nila is that recidivists would constitute anywhere between 3 to 5 percent of those being released.

asr-001333
01:51:40.480 --> 01:51:42.520
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So relatively low.

asr-001334
01:51:42.520 --> 01:51:43.740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So ulitin ko ulit ano?

asr-001335
01:51:44.800 --> 01:51:50.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Gusto ko makita yung record na yung mga PDL na 20, 30 years.

asr-001336
01:51:51.080 --> 01:51:51.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nag...

asr-001337
01:51:51.440 --> 01:51:53.320
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Napiit doon sa loob ng Bucor.

asr-001338
01:51:53.880 --> 01:51:58.200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: E paglabas nila, dapat meron silang pera na ipon yun through the years ng pagtatrabaho nila.

asr-001339
01:51:58.660 --> 01:51:59.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Manual labor.

asr-001340
01:51:59.760 --> 01:52:01.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Is it 1 peso? 2 peso per day?

asr-001341
01:52:02.180 --> 01:52:02.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 2 pesos per day?

asr-001342
01:52:03.260 --> 01:52:04.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Magkano man siweldo nila?

asr-001343
01:52:09.080 --> 01:52:09.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 500 pesos.

asr-001344
01:52:09.800 --> 01:52:10.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wow! Malaki yan ah.

asr-001345
01:52:11.160 --> 01:52:12.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Minimum 500 pesos.

asr-001346
01:52:12.120 --> 01:52:13.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 500 pesos per month.

asr-001347
01:52:13.420 --> 01:52:14.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Itimes nun ng 20 years.

asr-001348
01:52:15.040 --> 01:52:16.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: O, saan napunta?

asr-001349
01:52:16.840 --> 01:52:20.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: E kaso itong mga PDL pupunta sa akin, walang-wala sir eh.

asr-001350
01:52:20.920 --> 01:52:21.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala ro talaga.

asr-001351
01:52:21.420 --> 01:52:23.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pati damit, wala silang damit.

asr-001352
01:52:24.340 --> 01:52:26.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eh kung ano lang yung suot nila, yun ang damit nila.

asr-001353
01:52:29.300 --> 01:52:32.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung iba daw kasi, ang pat ang kanilang gawain,

asr-001354
01:52:32.780 --> 01:52:38.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: pag kinita na, pinapadala na sa mga kamag-anakan.

asr-001355
01:52:38.820 --> 01:52:39.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So hindi nila...

asr-001356
01:52:39.780 --> 01:52:40.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sorry ah.

asr-001357
01:52:40.720 --> 01:52:41.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sorry.

asr-001358
01:52:41.300 --> 01:52:42.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: No, mali yan.

asr-001359
01:52:43.080 --> 01:52:44.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat hinuhold nyo yun.

asr-001360
01:52:44.520 --> 01:52:45.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Huwag nyo binibigay.

asr-001361
01:52:45.300 --> 01:52:46.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ibigay nyo kapag na-release na.

asr-001362
01:52:47.780 --> 01:52:50.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eh kasi kung ibigay nyo during incarceration,

asr-001363
01:52:50.300 --> 01:52:51.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: eh talagang magagas.

asr-001364
01:52:51.420 --> 01:52:54.320
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bibilis na sigarilyo, magsugal pa doon.

asr-001365
01:52:54.640 --> 01:52:55.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mawawala nga yun.

asr-001366
01:52:55.440 --> 01:52:56.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ibibigay nyo yun pag na-release na.

asr-001367
01:52:57.300 --> 01:52:59.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nang sagay yung pag-release nila, meron silang pera.

asr-001368
01:53:00.900 --> 01:53:01.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-001369
01:53:01.860 --> 01:53:03.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They will revisit the policy.

asr-001370
01:53:03.880 --> 01:53:07.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Their dilemma is that it's the family that is asking for the money.

asr-001371
01:53:07.720 --> 01:53:08.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Forget about the family.

asr-001372
01:53:09.900 --> 01:53:11.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat yung policy,

asr-001373
01:53:11.460 --> 01:53:14.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: kailangan kung ano yung policy natin na ikagaganda, ikabubuti,

asr-001374
01:53:15.340 --> 01:53:16.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nung PDL paglaya niya.

asr-001375
01:53:16.760 --> 01:53:19.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yun yung sundin natin na paglaya niya, meron siyang pera,

asr-001376
01:53:19.300 --> 01:53:20.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: hindi siya mukhang kawawa.

asr-001377
01:53:20.140 --> 01:53:21.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Diba?

asr-001378
01:53:22.520 --> 01:53:23.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then isa pa, ano?

asr-001379
01:53:24.180 --> 01:53:27.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yung binibigay nyo yung transportation doon sa PDL,

asr-001380
01:53:27.900 --> 01:53:29.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: kung saan siya kinasuhan.

asr-001381
01:53:30.620 --> 01:53:32.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I have this case recently.

asr-001382
01:53:32.820 --> 01:53:34.320
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I think this was a couple of weeks ago.

asr-001383
01:53:34.960 --> 01:53:37.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Na nakulong siya sa Muntinupa.

asr-001384
01:53:38.020 --> 01:53:39.520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Una sa Muntinupa siya kinasuhan, sa Manila.

asr-001385
01:53:39.620 --> 01:53:41.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then na transfer siya sa Iwahig.

asr-001386
01:53:42.360 --> 01:53:43.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: I think, was it Iwahig?

asr-001387
01:53:44.000 --> 01:53:45.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Or Iwahig?

asr-001388
01:53:45.980 --> 01:53:49.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then binigay siya ng pamasahe, papunta lamang ng Manila.

asr-001389
01:53:49.300 --> 01:53:49.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ah.

asr-001390
01:53:50.140 --> 01:53:55.080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: In fact, ang tutuloyan niya, bahay niya talaga, is butuan.

asr-001391
01:53:56.760 --> 01:53:57.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sorry, agusan.

asr-001392
01:53:58.300 --> 01:54:00.160
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So binigyan ko ng pamasahe, papuntang agusan.

asr-001393
01:54:00.280 --> 01:54:01.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Binigyan ko pa ng konting allowance.

asr-001394
01:54:01.560 --> 01:54:02.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dahil walang-wala talaga, zero.

asr-001395
01:54:03.440 --> 01:54:04.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eh kung hindi natin tulungan yun,

asr-001396
01:54:05.400 --> 01:54:07.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: eh baka makapag-isipin gumawa ng kalukuan.

asr-001397
01:54:07.120 --> 01:54:09.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Magtinda ng drugs, whatever, magnakaw.

asr-001398
01:54:09.560 --> 01:54:11.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So dapat meron tayong full support sa kanila.

asr-001399
01:54:11.300 --> 01:54:14.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nang sa ngayon, ma-rehabilitate natin sila post-release.

asr-001400
01:54:15.020 --> 01:54:19.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Para pag i-reintegrate natin sila sa society,

asr-001401
01:54:19.400 --> 01:54:20.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: they'll be productive.

asr-001402
01:54:20.140 --> 01:54:21.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: They'll be productive members of the society.

asr-001403
01:54:22.220 --> 01:54:22.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yun.

asr-001404
01:54:23.140 --> 01:54:23.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-001405
01:54:25.100 --> 01:54:31.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: I think we should likewise look into the budget for the transportation.

asr-001406
01:54:32.120 --> 01:54:35.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasi kung butuan yun, malaking malaking halaga rin yun.

asr-001407
01:54:35.160 --> 01:54:40.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And they only have 2.4 million pesos for transportation and gratuity annually.

asr-001408
01:54:40.960 --> 01:54:43.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Eh dagdagan lang natin.

asr-001409
01:54:43.500 --> 01:54:46.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi kung ganun walang transportation, so anong gagawin ng PDL?

asr-001410
01:54:46.220 --> 01:54:47.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So magnakaw muna, mag-snatch dyan.

asr-001411
01:54:48.200 --> 01:54:50.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Para may pamasahe, papunta sa pamilya, sa probigyan.

asr-001412
01:54:50.140 --> 01:54:51.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So let's think about that.

asr-001413
01:54:52.140 --> 01:54:54.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And make sure na magawa natin ng remedy yan.

asr-001414
01:54:54.840 --> 01:54:56.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung kailan budget, I will support.

asr-001415
01:54:56.520 --> 01:55:00.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Para naman itong mga PDL na napabago na natin sa loob ng bilangguan.

asr-001416
01:55:00.580 --> 01:55:02.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Paglabas, hindi na sila gagawa ng...

asr-001417
01:55:03.180 --> 01:55:04.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi ka nais-nais.

asr-001418
01:55:04.440 --> 01:55:10.040
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: With the support of the good senator, we will provide the data and the recommendation in terms of an increase.

asr-001419
01:55:10.120 --> 01:55:12.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Couple of questions na lang sa Bucor.

asr-001420
01:55:13.200 --> 01:55:16.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Paano nakakalusot yung drugs at sa mga kontrabando sa loob ng Bucor?

asr-001421
01:55:16.480 --> 01:55:17.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Akala ko very tight ang security.

asr-001422
01:55:18.560 --> 01:55:19.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bakit nakakalusot?

asr-001423
01:55:20.140 --> 01:55:34.080
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ang kanilang naging karanasan ay right now, nahuhuli na raw bago pa pumasok.

asr-001424
01:55:34.340 --> 01:55:39.660
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But ang mga nahuhuli, actually, yung mga kamag-anakan ang nagpapasok sa loob.

asr-001425
01:55:39.660 --> 01:55:50.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So tinatago sa katawan at nahuhuli naman.

asr-001426
01:55:50.140 --> 01:56:08.740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So yung isang insidente, dalawa ang dinalahan niya ng drugs.

asr-001427
01:56:09.660 --> 01:56:12.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung asawa at yung anak.

asr-001428
01:56:13.100 --> 01:56:18.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So nahuli yun dahil magdadala ng drugs doon sa kamag-anakan niyang dalawa.

asr-001429
01:56:18.380 --> 01:56:18.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

asr-001430
01:56:20.140 --> 01:56:24.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mr. President, kasi tuwing gagawa ng Operation Greyhound, which is very good, which is very commendable,

asr-001431
01:56:25.420 --> 01:56:29.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: pero every time na lang, meron talaga at meron nahuli ng mga kutsilyo, mga kontrabando.

asr-001432
01:56:30.020 --> 01:56:32.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So ibig sabihin, may nakakalusot.

asr-001433
01:56:32.560 --> 01:56:33.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Paano nakakalusot yun?

asr-001434
01:56:33.520 --> 01:56:36.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Saan doon nagkukulang ang Bucor security?

asr-001435
01:56:40.580 --> 01:56:42.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Di ba may nahuling knife?

asr-001436
01:56:42.820 --> 01:56:46.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Alam ka ba yung knife ilagay sa private parts ng mga...

asr-001437
01:56:46.760 --> 01:56:50.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Meron na silang existing machines for screening.

asr-001438
01:56:50.140 --> 01:56:58.700
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So minsan kasi nga, pag tinago sa katawan, hindi na lalabas doon sa screening.

asr-001439
01:56:59.040 --> 01:57:02.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero yung metal detector, hindi pala, iba pala yun.

asr-001440
01:57:02.300 --> 01:57:03.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kutsilyo, oo, metal detector.

asr-001441
01:57:04.760 --> 01:57:09.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Di ba meron na dideliver ata ng mga supplies sa Bucor truck?

asr-001442
01:57:10.760 --> 01:57:17.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron ba kayong x-ray machine for vehicles that enters the Bucor as opposed to aso-aso lang?

asr-001443
01:57:17.620 --> 01:57:19.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Or I don't know.

asr-001444
01:57:20.140 --> 01:57:26.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: O baka physical inspection ang ginagawa ng mga tauhan nyo at medyo inaantok-antok pa, kaya nakakalusot?

asr-001445
01:57:27.920 --> 01:57:28.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-001446
01:57:29.280 --> 01:57:32.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Right now, mano-mano pa lang ang kanilang search.

asr-001447
01:57:32.520 --> 01:57:36.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So a x-ray machine should be...

asr-001448
01:57:36.240 --> 01:57:37.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Matagal ko na ang ano yun, sinuggested.

asr-001449
01:57:37.940 --> 01:57:40.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Two years ago pa na dapat bumili ng x-ray machine.

asr-001450
01:57:41.200 --> 01:57:44.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Na lahat ng sasakyan na dumadang, maging sasakyan ni boss kung sino yung pinaka-chip,

asr-001451
01:57:44.840 --> 01:57:46.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: dadaan talaga doon, walang exemption.

asr-001454
01:57:50.140 --> 01:57:57.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So inuna muna yung screening machine para sa katawan, bago yung x-ray machine.

asr-001455
01:57:57.640 --> 01:58:01.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So isusunod na yung mga baggage, yung screening machine.

asr-001456
01:58:01.500 --> 01:58:02.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero yung...

asr-001457
01:58:02.140 --> 01:58:06.580
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, ang susunod na is for the vehicle.

asr-001458
01:58:06.860 --> 01:58:09.120
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So we will include that in the budget.

asr-001459
01:58:09.980 --> 01:58:15.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And lastly, siguro for now, kung wala pang budget, may pag-coordinate ang Bucor sa TSWD

asr-001460
01:58:15.140 --> 01:58:18.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: para doon sa mga na-release ng mga PDL.

asr-001461
01:58:19.000 --> 01:58:20.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eh, tingnan.

asr-001462
01:58:20.140 --> 01:58:23.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung anong programa meron ng TSWD to help and support them.

asr-001463
01:58:24.320 --> 01:58:25.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ito sa pamasahe.

asr-001464
01:58:29.680 --> 01:58:31.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pasok kasi lahat yun sa AICS eh.

asr-001466
01:58:34.240 --> 01:58:38.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: O yun. So meron na silang coordination with the TSWD beginning when?

asr-001468
01:58:40.220 --> 01:58:46.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Na meron na. Lahat ng nire-release nilang PDL, meron ng AICS na.

asr-001469
01:58:46.540 --> 01:58:48.080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: But they are not well informed about that.

asr-001470
01:58:48.800 --> 01:58:49.200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: They are not.

asr-001471
01:58:49.200 --> 01:58:53.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi if they know about that, then imbis na pumunta sa programa ko, dumarit siya nang sasana sa TSWD.

asr-001472
01:58:54.180 --> 01:58:58.880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And another thing also, Bucor, get your act together.

asr-001473
01:58:59.580 --> 01:59:00.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Totoo to.

asr-001474
01:59:00.340 --> 01:59:04.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Na kapag na-release yung isang PDL, dapat kayo nag-reach out sa mga kamag-anak.

asr-001475
01:59:05.380 --> 01:59:07.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hinahanapan nyo may kamag-anak ka pa ba?

asr-001476
01:59:07.160 --> 01:59:10.320
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Saan ba yung last na alam mo kamag-anak ko sa Butuan po, sa Agusan?

asr-001477
01:59:10.900 --> 01:59:16.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tatawagan nyo, tawagin sila chairman para siguraduhin na paglabas niya, meron siya pupuntahan.

asr-001478
01:59:16.780 --> 01:59:18.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And as opposed to, pabayan natin niya.

asr-001479
01:59:18.120 --> 01:59:18.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bahala ka dyan maggulong-gulong.

asr-001480
01:59:19.200 --> 01:59:23.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maggulong dyan sa kalsada, papasok ulit sa krimen yun.

asr-001481
01:59:23.740 --> 01:59:24.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala eh.

asr-001482
01:59:24.580 --> 01:59:25.880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala kang ganun programa.

asr-001483
01:59:26.140 --> 01:59:27.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Basta pakawalan nyo na lang, bahala ka na.

asr-001484
01:59:28.320 --> 01:59:34.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat meron tatawag mga taga-Bucor, magkipag-connect sa mga kamag-anak para sabihin,

asr-001485
01:59:34.320 --> 01:59:42.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: o kamag-anak, itong relative nyo, marilis na tomorrow, o salubungin nyo, or diba?

asr-001486
01:59:42.860 --> 01:59:46.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Or baka meron kayong habilin, meron kayong gustong ipadala na anything.

asr-001487
01:59:46.780 --> 01:59:48.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: You don't do that eh.

asr-001488
01:59:48.600 --> 01:59:49.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Promise me.

asr-001489
01:59:49.200 --> 01:59:49.500
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: You don't do that.

asr-001490
01:59:49.720 --> 01:59:51.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pag sinabi mo ginagawa niyan, magagalit ako.

asr-001491
