asr-003055
03:32:43.220 --> 03:32:51.880
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: na kasama natin sa paghihimay ng budget ng ating bansa, particularly the 2027 budget.

asr-003056
03:32:52.080 --> 03:32:56.080
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: At papasalamat po ako sa kanilang sakripisyo.

asr-003057
03:32:57.180 --> 03:33:06.080
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Alam ko, walang sweldo, walang allowance na kukuha, pero pagmamahal lang po sa bayan ang kanilang binibigay

asr-003058
03:33:06.800 --> 03:33:10.440
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: para po mabantayan ang bawat sentimo ng ating pambansang budget.

asr-003059
03:33:10.600 --> 03:33:14.200
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: So maraming salamat kay Mr. Ken Abante at sa People's Budget Coalition.

asr-003060
03:33:15.160 --> 03:33:15.720
