asr-003071
03:34:16.620 --> 03:34:21.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: in an inspection ni Senate President ngayon at ating chairman ng finance.

asr-003072
03:34:22.080 --> 03:34:23.360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: May pagbabago naman.

asr-003073
03:34:24.500 --> 03:34:30.060
