03:51:04.820 --> 03:51:09.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Siguro ang ginawa, eh pinaredy muna yung mga tubig, nilakasan, kasi darating photo ops,

asr-003240
03:51:10.000 --> 03:51:10.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: pinalakasan tubig.

asr-003241
03:51:11.120 --> 03:51:13.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero alam nyo naman, nakikita nyo naman, nung pumunta kami doon,

asr-003242
03:51:14.320 --> 03:51:16.020
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: surprise visit, kausap naman yung mga farmers.

asr-003243
03:51:16.100 --> 03:51:19.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: The farmers themselves said na talagang hirap daw yung patubig.

asr-003244
03:51:20.660 --> 03:51:26.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Siguro, it's about time na inspectionin ng NIA at ayusin natin yung problema doon.

asr-003245
03:51:26.140 --> 03:51:32.360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi tulad nitong barangay Santa Cruz, Laguna, may solar power irrigation system na tinayo nung 2021

asr-003246
03:51:32.360 --> 03:51:35.020
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at target na patubig, humigit kumulang 70 hektarya.

asr-003247
03:51:35.560 --> 03:51:40.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero ayon sa mga magsasaka, mula umpisa, mahina na ang pressure at tuloy hindi na nagamit.

asr-003248
03:51:40.760 --> 03:51:41.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, sa yun.

asr-003249
03:51:42.300 --> 03:51:53.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sa barangay Patimbaw, barangay Hasaan, may report na nawawala o ninakaw ang motherhood cables at ibang pyesa.

asr-003250
03:51:54.020 --> 03:51:56.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kapag ganito nangyari, sino ang mananakaw?

asr-003251
03:51:56.140 --> 03:51:58.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: NIA ba? Contractor ba? LGU ba?

asr-003252
03:51:58.860 --> 03:52:02.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: O iniwan na lang sa mga magsasaka na walang patubig at walang sagot?

asr-003253
03:52:04.200 --> 03:52:10.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, ina-acknowledge ng NIA na may mga insidente ng nakaraan na ninanakaw nga itong mga equipment.

asr-003254
03:52:11.160 --> 03:52:24.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kaya, minabuti nilang gumawa ng memorandum of agreement kasama ang LGU at ang barangay para sa pagprotekta nitong mga kable na ito.

asr-003255
03:52:24.020 --> 03:52:24.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, pangalawa,

asr-003256
03:52:26.140 --> 03:52:35.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: yung subcommittee report, Mr. President, sinama natin yung transparency portal.

asr-003257
03:52:35.600 --> 03:52:51.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ibig sabihin, maaaring i-report ng sino man yung mga problemang nabanggit ni Sen. Rafi Tulfo para ito ay mapaabot sa kinaukulan.

asr-003258
03:52:51.500 --> 03:52:55.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And that transparency portal is accessible to...

asr-003259
03:52:56.140 --> 03:52:57.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: the public.

asr-003260
03:52:57.680 --> 03:53:05.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kaya, ang dapat siguro dyan, magkaroon din ang information campaign para yung mga gustong magreklamo,

asr-003261
03:53:05.760 --> 03:53:12.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: pagkatapos nilang puntahan si Sen. Rafi Tulfo, pumunta sila dun sa transparency portal at i-report din nila roon.

asr-003262
03:53:12.860 --> 03:53:16.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Para doble ang magiging pagbabantay po natin.

asr-003263
03:53:16.560 --> 03:53:24.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tama, gusto ko yun. Yung sinabi nyo kanina, Mr. President, na meron kayong gagawing coordination sa mga taga-LGU, mga tanod,

asr-003264
03:53:24.660 --> 03:53:26.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: para bantayan yung mga irrigation.

asr-003265
03:53:26.140 --> 03:53:32.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Upang nagsagay yun, hindi mapagsamantalahan ng mga magnanakaw, nakawin yung mga kable, etc.

asr-003266
03:53:33.620 --> 03:53:38.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, isang magandang paraan yun. Siguro kasama ng PNP, meron coordination.

asr-003267
03:53:38.460 --> 03:53:42.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At yung mga huli na magnanakaw ng kable, ikulong para masampulan at magkaroon silang takot.

asr-003268
03:53:43.480 --> 03:53:44.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Now, sa barangay...

asr-003269
03:53:44.780 --> 03:53:53.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: If I may add, Senator, Senate President, ako mismo, I'd like to get the details of the location.

asr-003270
03:53:53.480 --> 03:53:55.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At ako mismo, bilang inyong chairman...

asr-003271
03:53:56.140 --> 03:54:02.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ang Senate Committee on Agriculture, ay bibisitahin po natin para mamonitor ang progreso nito.

asr-003272
03:54:04.300 --> 03:54:10.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay. Itong Irrigators Association, tulad ng girl na magsalita doon, ano ba talagang papel nila?

asr-003273
03:54:11.160 --> 03:54:12.520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: They're not farmers, right?

asr-003274
03:54:13.680 --> 03:54:15.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They are farmers, officers.

asr-003275
03:54:16.860 --> 03:54:18.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But they are also farmer members.

asr-003276
03:54:18.980 --> 03:54:22.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero they collect money, they receive money from NIA. And why is that?

asr-003277
03:54:22.620 --> 03:54:24.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Why are they receiving money from NIA?

asr-003278
03:54:26.140 --> 03:54:45.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes. Ito ay programa ng NIA na nagbibigay ng gobyerno na tumutulong sa Irrigators Association para may subsidiya ng 500 pesos per hectare para mapatubigan.

asr-003279
03:54:45.600 --> 03:54:52.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In other words, dati kasi may nakongolektang...

asr-003280
03:54:52.600 --> 03:54:54.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Irrigators Association.

asr-003281
03:54:56.140 --> 03:55:05.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ...irrigation service fee, yung mga IAs, para ito ay pondo para ma-maintain nila yung irrigation systems.

asr-003282
03:55:06.480 --> 03:55:06.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-003283
03:55:06.800 --> 03:55:18.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero nung ito ay ginawa ng libre, nung 2018, pinalitan na lang ng 500 pesos per hectare na patubig na subsidiya.

asr-003284
03:55:19.980 --> 03:55:23.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So it's really a support for the Farmers Association and it is...

asr-003285
03:55:24.300 --> 03:55:25.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: How many Farmers Association?

asr-003286
03:55:26.140 --> 03:55:35.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Nung ako yung chairperson ng NIA, nung 2014 at 2015, malaking papel ng Irrigators Association.

asr-003287
03:55:38.300 --> 03:55:42.680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Napaka-mahalaga na organized ang ating mga rice farmers.

asr-003288
03:55:42.680 --> 03:55:55.680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So there are 11,215 Irrigators Association throughout the country that is comprising 1.3 million farmers.

asr-003289
03:55:56.140 --> 03:55:59.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So yun po, ang nature ng IAs.

asr-003290
03:56:00.400 --> 03:56:15.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In fact, I remember at one point, may international award ng NIA because of the Irrigators Association's setup.

asr-003291
03:56:15.800 --> 03:56:25.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, because of the participatory approach to irrigation systems, naipanalo nila.

asr-003292
03:56:25.020 --> 03:56:28.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ang isang international award ng NIA.

asr-003293
03:56:28.740 --> 03:56:40.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But yun, so mahalaga kasing kasama ang ating mga magsasaka doon sa pagpapatupad at pagpapamanage ng communal irrigation systems.

asr-003294
03:56:40.960 --> 03:56:43.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Dahil nga sila naman ang makikinabang.

asr-003295
03:56:43.380 --> 03:56:48.980
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So dapat they are in partnership, in tandem with the government.

asr-003296
03:56:49.460 --> 03:56:50.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay, thank you.

asr-003297
03:56:50.700 --> 03:56:54.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mr. President, ngayon sa Barangay San Pablo Sur, pumunta rin yung mga...

asr-003298
03:56:55.020 --> 03:57:01.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Target daw ng SPIS na patubigan ng sampung hektarya o 10 hectares.

asr-003299
03:57:01.560 --> 03:57:09.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero ayon sa mga magsasaka isang hektare lang sa tabi mismo ng pasilidad, ang talagang napapatubigan.

asr-003300
03:57:11.900 --> 03:57:15.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So ang tanong, how do you explain ang ganitong kalaking difference?

asr-003301
03:57:16.300 --> 03:57:22.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 10 hectares ang nasa plano pero isang hektare lang ang kinabang sa patubigan.

asr-003302
03:57:22.680 --> 03:57:24.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: This is in San Pedro Sur.

asr-003303
03:57:25.020 --> 03:57:26.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In Santa Cruz? Is that correct?

asr-003304
03:57:26.160 --> 03:57:29.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yes, Mr. President. Barangay San Pablo Sur.

asr-003305
03:57:30.600 --> 03:57:32.800
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: San Pablo. San Pablo Sur.

asr-003306
03:57:37.200 --> 03:57:37.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-003307
03:57:37.720 --> 03:58:03.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So they need to validate it, Mr. President.

asr-003308
03:58:03.600 --> 03:58:06.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero ang kanilang initial na...

asr-003309
03:58:07.720 --> 03:58:18.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pagtingin ay maaaring hindi pinapadaan yung mga tubo doon sa kapwa nila, Irrigators Association member.

asr-003310
03:58:18.800 --> 03:58:27.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, pero pag pumasok na ang MIYA para i-validate ito, matutugunan nila yung problema nito.

asr-003311
03:58:27.200 --> 03:58:32.460
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And they will report back immediately to us and to you.

asr-003312
03:58:32.660 --> 03:58:37.360
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And we will relay the action taken to you, good Senator.

asr-003313
03:58:37.720 --> 03:58:43.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yun ang observation ko, at saka observation ng mga farmers, na kulang sa monitoring was na nagawa yung proyekto.

asr-003314
03:58:43.600 --> 03:58:45.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi pa nga gawa yung proyekto. Pinapabayaan na.

asr-003315
03:58:45.840 --> 03:58:47.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pabayaan na nang mabubulok dyan.

asr-003316
03:58:47.660 --> 03:58:49.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: In some cases, nang nakawan.

asr-003317
03:58:50.040 --> 03:58:57.880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So dapat merong complete monitoring even after na magawa ng proyekto to ensure na talagang kapakipakinabang sa mga farmers.

asr-003318
03:58:58.320 --> 03:58:59.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We agree, Mr. President.

asr-003319
03:58:59.720 --> 03:59:05.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Anyway, I'll give you a list of these sites na pinuntahan ng mga staff ko.

asr-003320
03:59:06.040 --> 03:59:06.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At may mga problema talagang...

asr-003321
03:59:07.720 --> 03:59:09.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Actual inspection ang ginawa.

asr-003322
03:59:10.320 --> 03:59:11.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: May mga interview ng mga farmers.

asr-003323
03:59:11.780 --> 03:59:12.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dalawa na lamang.

asr-003324
03:59:12.540 --> 03:59:22.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Itong sa Barangay Calios, hindi tinanggap ng mga magsasaka ang proyekto dahil mahina ang tubig at hindi masuplayan ang target na 15 hectares.

asr-003325
03:59:23.580 --> 03:59:26.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: NIA mismo raw ang nagsabi na may problema ang kontraktor.

asr-003326
03:59:27.460 --> 03:59:29.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Inamin ng NIA na may problema sa kontraktor.

asr-003327
03:59:30.480 --> 03:59:31.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sino ang kontraktor?

asr-003328
03:59:32.560 --> 03:59:33.660
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Magkano ang kontrata?

asr-003329
03:59:34.660 --> 03:59:35.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ano ang depekto?

asr-003330
03:59:35.760 --> 03:59:37.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At ganun-ganun lang.

asr-003331
03:59:37.720 --> 03:59:39.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ba? Wala bang parusa doon sa kontraktor?

asr-003332
03:59:41.940 --> 03:59:43.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At kailan nyo ito ayusin?

asr-003333
03:59:44.320 --> 03:59:48.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sa ngayon kasi nakatiwangwang at hindi tinanggap ng mga farmers kasi nga bulok daw.

asr-003334
03:59:54.160 --> 03:59:56.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, ang kontraktor ay si...

asr-003336
04:00:00.000 --> 04:00:14.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ASC construction, pero according to RD de la Cruz ng Region 4A, inayos na daw. Kailan?

asr-003337
04:00:14.480 --> 04:00:37.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, inayos na daw nila. Beginning last week at natapos this week. So, inayos na daw ng kontrakto. Nagkakalyo na yung kontrakto sa kakaayos.

asr-003338
04:00:37.740 --> 04:00:44.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sige. Ito sa barangay Hasaan. Napansin ang mga magsasaka na ang SPIL.

asr-003339
04:00:44.480 --> 04:00:57.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yes. Ay kumukuha lang ng tubig mula sa kanal. Sa kanal kumukuha ng tubig. Hindi sa mas malalim na source. Kung taginit at mahina ang tubig sa kanal, saan kukuha ng tubig ang pump?

asr-003340
04:00:57.540 --> 04:01:05.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: May ginagawa ba talaga kayong feasibility study bago kayo gumawa ng project? O project dito, project dyan lang ang kaya niyong gawin dyan sa naia?

asr-003341
04:01:07.740 --> 04:01:14.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Walang pag-aaral na ginagawa bago planuhin at umpisaan yung proyekto?

asr-003342
04:01:14.480 --> 04:01:20.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Basta meron lang mga project at meron makuhang budget. O, di. Okay na.

asr-003343
04:01:24.920 --> 04:01:25.780
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes.

asr-003344
04:01:27.360 --> 04:01:28.820
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yung kanilang

asr-003345
04:01:28.820 --> 04:01:34.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: J-O-Resistivity

asr-003346
04:01:34.140 --> 04:01:40.260
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Meron silang pagtitiak o pag

asr-003347
04:01:40.260 --> 04:01:43.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: J-O-Resistivity

asr-003348
04:01:44.480 --> 04:01:47.500
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: na intervention para malaman o matiyak

asr-003349
04:01:47.500 --> 04:01:48.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: kung yung

asr-003350
04:01:48.240 --> 04:01:51.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: volume at

asr-003351
04:01:51.060 --> 04:01:52.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ng tubig.

asr-003352
04:01:52.780 --> 04:01:54.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, may mga

asr-003353
04:01:54.740 --> 04:01:56.920
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: insidente in this case

asr-003354
04:01:56.920 --> 04:02:01.460
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: na kahit makita nila

asr-003355
04:02:01.460 --> 04:02:03.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: dun sa J-O-Resistivity

asr-003356
04:02:04.420 --> 04:02:07.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: intervention na tubig

asr-003357
04:02:07.540 --> 04:02:08.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: nga ay available,

asr-003358
04:02:09.340 --> 04:02:10.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: lumalabas kulang.

asr-003359
04:02:10.420 --> 04:02:12.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Lalo na

asr-003360
04:02:12.640 --> 04:02:14.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: pagka after the pump test.

asr-003361
04:02:14.480 --> 04:02:26.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, parang in many, in a number of instances parang hit or miss kasi kulang sa technology kasi yung may mga advanced technology.

asr-003362
04:02:26.340 --> 04:02:40.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes. So, so, yun ang dilema nila, no? But, anong ginawa ninyo? Dito.

asr-003363
04:02:40.340 --> 04:02:43.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: O.

asr-003364
04:02:43.340 --> 04:02:48.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kaya nga, tapos, may problema nga. Anong next?

asr-003365
04:02:48.200 --> 04:02:54.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At, so, you will conduct again.

asr-003366
04:02:54.200 --> 04:02:58.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They will conduct additional J-O-Resistivity

asr-003367
04:02:58.200 --> 04:03:05.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: in the adjacent areas, pero kung wala talaga, ililipat nila.

asr-003368
04:03:05.200 --> 04:03:09.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But, you should validate it. Have you validated it?

asr-003369
04:03:09.200 --> 04:03:13.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Na-validate ba yung lugar na nabanggit? Hindi pa?

asr-003370
04:03:13.340 --> 04:03:19.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, we are, may we have a minute suspension, Mr. President, just to check.

asr-003371
04:03:19.200 --> 04:03:21.200
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kung wala na inspection.

asr-003372
04:03:21.200 --> 04:03:23.200
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: Session suspended.

asr-003389
04:05:41.340 --> 04:06:02.960
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: As explained to us by the regional director, kaya nasa kanal yun kasi it is an open source system. Ibig sabihin doon talaga kumukuha ng tubig. Hindi siya underground, hindi rin siya underground.

asr-003390
04:06:02.960 --> 04:06:23.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Now they are also informing us that they have to validate kung NIA project daw ito. Baka DA project daw ito. So they will have to validate that too. And we will submit to the good senator the results of their validation.

asr-003391
04:06:23.980 --> 04:06:32.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay, dalawang item na lang. Ito yung sasabihin ko sa mga taga-NIA, with your respect kay Sen. Kikok Pangilinan, kayo dyan sa NIA.

asr-003392
04:06:32.960 --> 04:06:43.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mga pabaya kayo eh. Kaya mainit ang ulo ko sa inyo eh noon pa dahil kawawa yung mga farmers natin. Wala kayong ginagawang inspection. Reactive kayo, hindi kayo proactive eh.

asr-003393
04:06:44.240 --> 04:06:54.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung merong problema nakarating sa inyo, nakarating na sumbong sa amin at pinating ko sa inyo, saka kayo ka-action. Pag nalaman niyo may inspection na ginawa yung mga staff ko, yung office ko, saka kayo ka-action.

asr-003394
04:06:55.280 --> 04:07:01.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat you don't wait for us to do inspection because that's your job. It's not our job as a matter of fact. We're just helping you.

asr-003395
04:07:01.040 --> 04:07:28.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang nangyari, you don't do anything until such time, the sumbong will get to my office and then i-expose ko kayo. Saka kayo action. Huwag ganon. Dapat nag-a-action kayo. Malaki namang budget nyo eh. Marami sa inyo sa NIA, mga tamad, nagpapalaki lang ng tiyan. Nagiging butete na lang, pasensya na. Totoo talaga dahil nakakapikon. Eh, hindi yung ginagawing trabaho nyo na dapat ginagampanan yan dahil kawawa naman yung mga farmers natin.

asr-003396
04:07:29.120 --> 04:07:30.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Anyway, sige.

asr-003397
04:07:31.040 --> 04:07:41.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sana, hindi sa inyo to. Pero just to let you know, yung kanal, hindi pwede talaga gamitin nyo kasi pagdating ng tag-init, matutuyit-matutuy yung kanal eh. Di saayay na yung irrigation.

asr-003398
04:07:41.920 --> 04:07:42.160
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

asr-003399
04:07:42.460 --> 04:07:43.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: That is correct.

asr-003400
04:07:43.280 --> 04:08:00.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, dalawa na lang. Hindi ba baba sa 800 RSBSA registered farmers ang maaring apektado sa mga barangay na ito? Santa Cruz, Laguna, lang ba ito? Paano ba napakaraming parte ng bansa ang umaasa sa irrigation?

asr-003401
04:08:01.040 --> 04:08:05.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, kretong remedyo meron kayo para sa mga magsasakang iniwan nyo sa ere.

asr-003402
04:08:18.480 --> 04:08:27.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Well, makikipag-coordinate sila sa DA para malaman ano ang maaring gawin ng dalawang ahensya para tugunan itong problema nito.

asr-003403
04:08:27.280 --> 04:08:30.880
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Dahil ang RSBSA, yan ang DA.

asr-003404
04:08:31.040 --> 04:08:46.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ito ay registry ng farmers. So, if there are over 400 of them, then the NIA together with the DA should coordinate efforts to address the issues of irrigation.

asr-003405
04:08:46.640 --> 04:08:58.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Ang DA din kasi may irrigation component ang kanilang programa. So, but that is not an excuse na magtuturoan sila at sabihin na hindi sa amin yan, sa inyo yan.

asr-003406
04:08:58.880 --> 04:08:59.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you.

asr-003407
04:08:59.020 --> 04:09:01.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They have to both address the challenges.

asr-003408
04:09:01.040 --> 04:09:06.000
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They have to address the challenges of irrigation, whether it's the NIA irrigation system or the DA irrigation system.

asr-003409
04:09:06.400 --> 04:09:11.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero, FYI lang, never pa ako nagkaroon ng problema o nakarating sa aking sumbong dahil naging pabaya ang DA.

asr-003410
04:09:12.600 --> 04:09:18.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Palagi talaga, 1 out of 10, 11 ang may problema talaga yung NIA.

asr-003411
04:09:19.200 --> 04:09:23.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay, so huwag natin ituro sa DA. DA has been doing good job, as far as I'm concerned.

asr-003412
04:09:23.880 --> 04:09:25.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay, bago kayo mingino...

asr-003413
04:09:25.640 --> 04:09:28.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Pero makataasa ang ating butihing senador, tayo mismo.

asr-003414
04:09:28.060 --> 04:09:29.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Okay.

asr-003415
04:09:31.040 --> 04:09:47.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Imo-monitor natin ito. Titiyakin natin yung kanilang monitoring dashboard ay nakaset up para yung taong bayan mismo ang pwedeng sumumbong at pumuna at mag-report.

asr-003416
04:09:48.000 --> 04:09:51.840
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And we will also exercise oversight sa ating committee.

asr-003417
04:09:51.840 --> 04:09:55.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: If I may suggest, Mr. President, siguro meron kayong...

asr-003418
04:09:55.920 --> 04:09:59.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ewan ko kung ito bang asosasyon ninyo.

asr-003419
04:10:01.040 --> 04:10:04.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kung ba'y napapakinabangan nyo talaga o wala rin itong maasahan.

asr-003420
04:10:05.140 --> 04:10:10.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat meron kayong isang tao sa bawat merong irrigation kayo na yung magbabantay, magmumonitor.

asr-003421
04:10:11.260 --> 04:10:17.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then pag nagka-problema, agad-agad tatawag sa inyo via cellphone o email o text para maaksyonan.

asr-003422
04:10:17.180 --> 04:10:23.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi yung matagal na nakatinga, inabot na ng dalawa, tatlo, apat, limang taon, nakatinga na dyan, hindi nagagamit.

asr-003423
04:10:23.040 --> 04:10:31.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And nung pagpunta namin, nakita namin yung problema and then lo and behold, after a few days, pupunta yung NIA.

asr-003424
04:10:31.040 --> 04:10:32.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi nabalitaan na nag-inspect kami, huwag ganun.

asr-003425
04:10:33.480 --> 04:10:35.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Dapat umaaksyon kayo bago kami umaaksyon.

asr-003426
04:10:36.520 --> 04:10:42.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Di napapahiya patuloy kayo, eh, nakarating sa madlam people yung kung kaano kayong klase magtrabaho.

asr-003427
04:10:42.600 --> 04:10:44.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, next time, dapat maging maagap.

asr-003428
04:10:45.700 --> 04:10:47.080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pagsabihan mo, Mr. President.

asr-003429
04:10:47.460 --> 04:10:51.680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: We will. We will do so, Senator Rafi. Maraming salamat.

asr-003430
04:10:53.260 --> 04:10:58.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay. So, ibig sabihin, bago kayong mingi na mas malaking pondo para sa bagong solar pumps,

asr-003431
04:10:59.100 --> 04:10:59.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ito ang tanong.

asr-003432
04:10:59.960 --> 04:11:00.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Handa ba kayong sumiti sa...

asr-003433
04:11:01.040 --> 04:11:05.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang kompletong inventory ng lahat ng SPIS.

asr-003434
04:11:05.780 --> 04:11:10.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Project cost, contractor, target hectares, actual hectares irrigated,

asr-003435
04:11:11.040 --> 04:11:14.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: operational status, mga ninakaw o silang components, repair history,

asr-003436
04:11:14.920 --> 04:11:17.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at kung tinanggap pa talaga ito ng mga magsasakay, et cetera.

asr-003437
04:11:18.240 --> 04:11:19.200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, are you ready for that?

asr-003438
04:11:19.980 --> 04:11:25.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, Mr. President. In fact, nirequire natin ito bilang subcommittee chair

asr-003439
04:11:25.140 --> 04:11:30.240
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: na yung mga solar pump irrigation projects nila,

asr-003440
04:11:31.040 --> 04:11:33.740
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ay bubusisigin natin, pati ang presyo.

asr-003441
04:11:33.820 --> 04:11:38.060
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: In fact, right now, ang People's Coalition, Budget Coalition,

asr-003442
04:11:38.360 --> 04:11:42.280
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ay binubusisipa itong mga proyekting ito.

asr-003443
04:11:42.420 --> 04:11:44.760
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: They're cross-checking yung cost,

asr-003444
04:11:45.540 --> 04:11:52.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: at ire-report nila sa atin para ma-incorporate natin yung findings nila

asr-003445
04:11:52.600 --> 04:11:58.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: dito sa final na magiging GAA, Special Provisions natin.

asr-003446
04:11:58.480 --> 04:12:00.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And even in the Special Provisions, Mr. President,

asr-003447
04:12:01.040 --> 04:12:07.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ilalagay talaga natin itong transparency portal at yung station number

asr-003448
04:12:07.900 --> 04:12:13.320
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: pati ang coordinates ng mga proyekto ng solar power irrigation, Mr. President.

asr-003449
04:12:13.400 --> 04:12:15.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay, last na lamang, Mr. President.

asr-003450
04:12:15.560 --> 04:12:20.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, nakita naman natin ang salita yung People's Power, People Budget Coalition,

asr-003451
04:12:20.960 --> 04:12:26.240
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na yung solar pump, na ang halaga lang niya dapat ay 7,000,

asr-003452
04:12:26.240 --> 04:12:30.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: pero sinacharge niya sa gobyerno niya.

asr-003453
04:12:31.040 --> 04:12:33.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 30,000 to 40,000, ba't ang layo ng discrepancy?

asr-003454
04:12:34.160 --> 04:12:35.200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang laki ng discrepancy.

asr-003455
04:12:36.040 --> 04:12:38.320
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang laki ng tubo, ang laki ng cut, ang laki ng taga.

asr-003456
04:12:38.920 --> 04:12:44.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Yes, in fact, na-coordinate natin yung pagpupulong ng NIA mismo,

asr-003457
04:12:44.960 --> 04:12:48.940
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: leadership, at yung People's Budget Coalition.

asr-003458
04:12:49.140 --> 04:12:53.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: At nagkaroon ng pagpapaliwanag tungkol doon sa disparity

asr-003459
04:12:53.100 --> 04:12:57.540
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: o yung difference between yung 7,000 na panel at yung 30,000.

asr-003460
04:12:57.540 --> 04:13:01.020
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: My understanding is the 30,000 is not the panel,

asr-003461
04:13:01.040 --> 04:13:01.680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: it's not the panel alone.

asr-003462
04:13:02.280 --> 04:13:12.220
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: It includes piping, panels, accessories, inverter, and controls,

asr-003463
04:13:12.600 --> 04:13:14.680
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: as well as the mounting structure cost.

asr-003464
04:13:15.440 --> 04:13:22.900
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: So, in other words, kaya 30,000 yung presyo, hindi yun yung panel lamang.

asr-003465
04:13:23.480 --> 04:13:28.380
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kasama doon yung full panel and accessories work item,

asr-003466
04:13:28.380 --> 04:13:30.720
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: including delivery, installation.

asr-003467
04:13:31.040 --> 04:13:32.180
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Taxes, et cetera.

asr-003468
04:13:32.680 --> 04:13:38.300
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: But, again, as I said, binubusisi pa rin ng People's Budget Coalition yan as we speak.

asr-003469
04:13:38.920 --> 04:13:46.480
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And lilinisi natin, ikanga, para matiyak na right price, right project, Mr. President.

asr-003470
04:13:46.520 --> 04:13:49.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Right price, right project, right monitoring.

asr-003471
04:13:49.400 --> 04:13:50.140
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Right monitoring.

asr-003472
04:13:50.240 --> 04:13:53.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Para siguro hindi masasayang yung pera ibinood doon sa proyekto.

asr-003473
04:13:53.680 --> 04:13:55.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maraming salamat, Mr. President. That's all.

asr-003474
04:13:55.280 --> 04:14:00.560
