asr-003475
04:14:01.040 --> 04:14:03.160
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: mga katanungan sa ating ahensya.

asr-003476
04:14:03.600 --> 04:14:07.100
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Makakaasa siya na titiyakin natin, babantayan natin,

asr-003477
04:14:07.640 --> 04:14:11.400
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: yung pondo at yung proyekto at yung performance.

asr-003478
04:14:12.040 --> 04:14:16.600
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Bilang chairman ng Committee on Agriculture, we will exercise oversight.

asr-003479
04:14:17.180 --> 04:14:23.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: And just as an additional note, in fairness to Sen. Rafi,

asr-003480
04:14:23.560 --> 04:14:29.420
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: is siya sa pinakamasipag na mag-attend ng mga committee hearings ng Committee on Agriculture.

asr-003481
04:14:29.680 --> 04:14:30.560
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Kaya alam kong...

asr-003482
04:14:31.040 --> 04:14:35.640
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: ...yung puso niya ay nararian, lalo na sa ating mga magsasaka.

asr-003483
04:14:35.640 --> 04:14:42.340
Senator Francis Kiko Pangilinan: Thank you, Mr. President. Thank you, Sen. Rafi, Tulfo, and maraming salamat.

asr-003484
