Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: wala silang direct knowledge

asr-004222
04:59:52.740 --> 04:59:54.640
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: or personal knowledge kung sino

asr-004223
04:59:54.640 --> 04:59:56.100
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: yung nangangailangan in certain

asr-004224
04:59:56.100 --> 04:59:57.960
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: localities, di ba?

asr-004225
05:00:00.000 --> 05:00:19.180
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Habang totoo, Mr. President, dahil sa Local Government Code,

asr-004226
05:00:19.280 --> 05:00:22.920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: devolved, isa sa mga governance functions na devolved sa LGUs

asr-004227
05:00:22.920 --> 05:00:25.120
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ay yung social welfare and development.

asr-004228
05:00:25.120 --> 05:00:29.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero meron pong nabuo sa pamamagitan din itong IECS program

asr-004229
05:00:29.580 --> 05:00:33.060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na social worker to social worker relationship,

asr-004230
05:00:33.240 --> 05:00:37.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: including yung social workers ng DSWD National.

asr-004231
05:00:38.040 --> 05:00:42.180
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So meron pa rin validation nung identification ng mga individuals

asr-004232
05:00:42.180 --> 05:00:46.880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na humihingi ng assistance at maaring mapatunay na nga nga ilangan,

asr-004233
05:00:47.040 --> 05:00:48.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: kaya't bibigyan, Mr. President.

asr-004234
05:00:49.060 --> 05:00:53.280
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Pagpapasensya nyo ng mga tanong ko kasi wala ko akong maski isang experience

asr-004235
05:00:53.280 --> 05:00:56.300
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: sa pag-distribute ng IECS eh, kaya ako nagtatanong.

asr-004236
05:00:57.600 --> 05:00:58.160
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Anyway.

asr-004237
05:00:58.160 --> 05:01:04.360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Ang pinupunto ko po rito is wala pong pag-aaral masyadong ginagawa.

asr-004238
05:01:05.160 --> 05:01:11.220
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: We're allocating or appropriating 48.14 billion in 2027.

asr-004239
05:01:12.300 --> 05:01:18.640
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: And dinisaggregate namin yung mga components ng IECS,

asr-004240
05:01:18.780 --> 05:01:23.640
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: food assistance, medical assistance, and other cash assistance.

asr-004241
05:01:23.820 --> 05:01:26.680
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Ito po medyo vague, cash assistance.

asr-004242
05:01:27.040 --> 05:01:27.920
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Under.

asr-004243
05:01:28.160 --> 05:01:34.080
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Under food assistance, meron naman talagang established na subprograms

asr-004244
05:01:34.080 --> 05:01:40.400
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: under DSWD na kung saan pwede nating ilipat na lamang doon

asr-004245
05:01:40.400 --> 05:01:47.500
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: yung pondo ng IECS, say dagdagan natin yung under the DSWD subprograms,

asr-004246
05:01:47.840 --> 05:01:52.480
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Philippine Food Stamp Strategic Transfer and Alternative Measures Program.

asr-004247
05:01:53.100 --> 05:01:54.980
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Meron silang 1.89 billion.

asr-004248
05:01:55.720 --> 05:01:57.980
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: What I'm trying to say here, Mr. President,

asr-004249
05:01:58.160 --> 05:02:05.520
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: this is my sponsor, yung 14.14 billion, baka pwede nating i-disaggregate,

asr-004250
05:02:05.880 --> 05:02:08.960
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: ilipat natin doon sa mga subprograms ng DSWD.

asr-004251
05:02:09.480 --> 05:02:16.120
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: At least, meron talagang programa at sigurado may mas magandang pag-aaral ng DSWD,

asr-004252
05:02:16.200 --> 05:02:18.320
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: the department, patungkol dito.

asr-004253
05:02:19.020 --> 05:02:22.560
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Unlike yung IECS na medyo may pagka-whimsical,

asr-004254
05:02:22.560 --> 05:02:28.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: at saka kung sino yung marunong lumapit sa mga program,

asr-004255
05:02:28.040 --> 05:02:29.900
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: mga politiko, yun ang mauna.

asr-004256
05:02:30.480 --> 05:02:32.760
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kaya nga misa nakahikaw ng ginto eh.

asr-004257
05:02:33.760 --> 05:02:36.780
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Hindi talaga nangangailangan, wala talaga sa crisis situation,

asr-004258
05:02:37.260 --> 05:02:40.560
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: nakakakuha sila ng biyaya galing sa IECS.

asr-004259
05:02:41.100 --> 05:02:45.360
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Second subprogram, supplementary feeding program.

asr-004260
05:02:46.280 --> 05:02:49.240
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Meron silang pondo na 6.359 billion.

asr-004261
05:02:49.240 --> 05:02:54.860
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Pwede siguro yung from the 48.14 billion portion of that

asr-004262
05:02:54.860 --> 05:02:57.860
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: could be transferred or realigned to the subprogram.

asr-004263
05:02:58.040 --> 05:03:10.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Reducing food insecurity and undernutrition with economic electronic vouchers project,

asr-004264
05:03:10.040 --> 05:03:13.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 3.88 billion.

asr-004265
05:03:13.040 --> 05:03:19.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Again, pwede rin tayo mag-augment siguro papunta rito ng galing sa IECS.

asr-004266
05:03:21.040 --> 05:03:27.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Reducing vulnerabilities of children from hunger and malnutrition in barn.

asr-004267
05:03:27.040 --> 05:03:28.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Reducing vulnerabilities of children from hunger and malnutrition in barn.

asr-004268
05:03:28.040 --> 05:03:30.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 163 million.

asr-004269
05:03:30.040 --> 05:03:37.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Anyway, at the proper time, I intend to introduce amendments along this line.

asr-004270
05:03:37.040 --> 05:03:44.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Of course, Mr. President, if I may, in principle, the subcommittee and I hope the department

asr-004271
05:03:44.040 --> 05:03:50.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: would be open to more of our proposed amendments mula dito sa Senado.

asr-004272
05:03:50.040 --> 05:03:57.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Just to make of record, sa ngayon po, yung mga binanggit ni Sen. Lacson would fall, for example,

asr-004273
05:03:57.040 --> 05:03:59.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: under locally funded projects.

asr-004274
05:03:59.040 --> 05:04:04.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yun po yung reducing vulnerabilities of children from hunger and malnutrition in barn.

asr-004275
05:04:04.040 --> 05:04:09.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At saka yung Walang Gutom 2027 na food stamp program.

asr-004276
05:04:09.040 --> 05:04:14.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yun namang pong reducing food insecurity and undernutrition with electronic vouchers.

asr-004277
05:04:14.040 --> 05:04:17.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yan po ay isa sa mga foreign-assisted projects.

asr-004278
05:04:17.040 --> 05:04:23.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Samantala, yung huling binanggit ng good gentleman from Cavite na supplementary feeding program,

asr-004279
05:04:23.040 --> 05:04:26.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: isa po siya sa protective social welfare program.

asr-004280
05:04:26.040 --> 05:04:34.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So lahat po nito ay mayroong very specific na target beneficiaries or participants.

asr-004281
05:04:34.040 --> 05:04:44.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kaya po sinosustain ang department yung AICS program ay para no one group na maaaring nangangailangan

asr-004282
05:04:44.040 --> 05:04:46.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: would fall through the cracks.

asr-004283
05:04:46.040 --> 05:04:52.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So kumbaga may mga dagdag pang types of assistance sa AICS na binanggit na rin ni Sen. Lacson,

asr-004284
05:04:52.040 --> 05:04:55.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: kasama na po yung medical assistance, funeral assistance.

asr-004285
05:04:55.040 --> 05:05:01.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Funeral assistance, transportation assistance, food assistance, at saka educational assistance, Mr. President.

asr-004286
05:05:01.040 --> 05:05:09.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So what you're trying to say, the single sponsor, is prepared ng DSWD na ma-retain yung AICS.

asr-004287
05:05:13.040 --> 05:05:18.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Why is that? I cannot, you know, parang hindi yata logical yung...

asr-004288
05:05:21.040 --> 05:05:24.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi alam ko AICS talaga mga politicians lang ang...

asr-004289
05:05:25.040 --> 05:05:28.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: halos nagpapalakad nito eh.

asr-004290
05:05:36.040 --> 05:05:40.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Gaya ng sinabi ko po sa opening budget statement, Mr. President,

asr-004291
05:05:40.040 --> 05:05:48.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: I think lahat tayo sa Senado gusto nating mas maipush yung mga pondo ng gobyerno

asr-004292
05:05:48.040 --> 05:05:52.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: papunta sa mga institutional and institutionalized programs.

asr-004293
05:05:52.040 --> 05:05:54.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Maybe it is also a matter of timing, Mr. President.

asr-004294
05:05:54.040 --> 05:06:01.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Dahil sa ngayon, tinuturing pa rin, pa rin, ang department ng AICS bilang isang catchment program

asr-004295
05:06:01.040 --> 05:06:12.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: para yung hindi pa ma-programmatically target at itemize in terms of the line item budget sa lahat pa ng mga programa nila.

asr-004296
05:06:12.040 --> 05:06:18.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At this time, meron pa rin silang catchment program, which is the AICS.

asr-004297
05:06:18.040 --> 05:06:23.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: But I share his honor's concern to...

asr-004298
05:06:23.040 --> 05:06:34.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: to progressively, continuously buffer yung mga pondo ng gobyerno from possibility of politization

asr-004299
05:06:34.040 --> 05:06:41.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: and push funds of the government towards institutionalized social protection programs.

asr-004300
05:06:41.040 --> 05:06:43.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Baka it's a matter of timing sa ngayon.

asr-004301
05:06:43.040 --> 05:06:49.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Lalo na alimbawa kung ikumpara natin sino mga beneficiaryo ng 4P, sino mga beneficiaryo ng AICS.

asr-004302
05:06:49.040 --> 05:06:52.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Sa ngayon, Mr. President, magkakaiba pa po sila.

asr-004303
05:06:52.040 --> 05:06:55.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Medyo distinct pa po sila, Mr. President.

asr-004304
05:06:55.040 --> 05:07:03.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Are you trying to impress on this representation, Your Honor, na may full control ang DSWD sa disbursement ng AICS?

asr-004305
05:07:03.040 --> 05:07:05.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Wala po sa kanilang sub-programs?

asr-004306
05:07:09.040 --> 05:07:14.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Do they have full control? Honestly, do they have full control over AICS?

asr-004307
05:07:14.040 --> 05:07:17.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Because if you tell me, I'll stop my interpolation.

asr-004308
05:07:17.040 --> 05:07:21.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Please don't stop your interpolation, Mr. President. It's always enriching.

asr-004309
05:07:21.040 --> 05:07:29.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: But pinaninindigan po ng DSWD that they have full control over the decision-making in the AICS program.

asr-004310
05:07:32.040 --> 05:07:38.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: I'm sorry but I don't believe that. Kasi kaya pinaglalaban to ng mga congressmen yung AICS.

asr-004311
05:07:38.040 --> 05:07:45.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Actually, meron tayong parang I think forthcoming na bicam, ito yung sa Bawal-EPAL.

asr-004312
05:07:45.040 --> 05:07:50.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Gusto sila tanggalin yung provision sa Bawal-EPAL. They want to retain that.

asr-004313
05:07:50.040 --> 05:07:52.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Na merong EPAL.

asr-004314
05:07:52.040 --> 05:08:01.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: I support the good gentleman in his efforts, both in the budget instrument saka sa legislation na bawasan hanggang matanggal po yun.

asr-004315
05:08:01.040 --> 05:08:15.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And to give credit where credit is due, yung recommendation ng ating Senate Committee Report on that item of the AICS is already lower than the 2027 GAB.

asr-004316
05:08:15.040 --> 05:08:18.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So kahit papano, we have sought this year na,

asr-004317
05:08:18.040 --> 05:08:29.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: tugunan yung internal desire ng Senate na mas i-push yung mga social protection funds towards institutionalized programs.

asr-004318
05:08:29.040 --> 05:08:36.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At bilang tugon na rin sa advocacy ng mga civil society partners natin sa mga budget reform advocates, Mr. President.

asr-004319
05:08:36.040 --> 05:08:46.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Well, I'm all for yung protective programs, social programs. Pero ayaw lang natin yung hindi institutionalized.

asr-004320
05:08:46.040 --> 05:08:57.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: At walang mga kriteriya na sufficient enough para mapunta talaga yung ayuda sa mga dapat makatanggap ng ayuda. That's the whole point.

asr-004321
05:08:57.040 --> 05:09:10.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Now, if the SWD is insisting or claiming na talaga may full control sila over the disbursement of AICS, then I'll take your word for it.

asr-004322
05:09:10.040 --> 05:09:15.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: But remember, we have this oversight function ng Senate.

asr-004323
05:09:15.040 --> 05:09:25.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: And there are horror stories. There were horror stories before, as I narrated to you earlier, na talagang hindi pumupunta sa dapat puntahan.

asr-004324
05:09:25.040 --> 05:09:40.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: And this came from former Senators. Hindi ito creation ng kusino but talagang account ito mismo ng dati nating kasamahan dito na yun ang experience nila sa pag-distribute ng...

asr-004325
05:09:40.040 --> 05:09:42.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Nagugulat nga eh.

asr-004326
05:09:42.040 --> 05:09:44.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: At sinasabing nga, nagulat sila bakit yung nakapila eh.

asr-004327
05:09:45.040 --> 05:09:47.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Ang gaganda ng hikaw.

asr-004328
05:09:47.040 --> 05:09:55.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: It's good for the department to hear this feedback from us, Mr. President. Kahit pa year after year.

asr-004329
05:09:55.040 --> 05:10:02.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And siguro that's behind yung hindi man overnight 100% success natin at pushing the funds.

asr-004330
05:10:02.040 --> 05:10:09.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Not just in this department, all departments na may social protection functions towards institutional programs.

asr-004331
05:10:09.040 --> 05:10:13.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At hindi po natin bibitawan ito year on year din, Mr. President.

asr-004332
05:10:13.040 --> 05:10:14.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Okay.

asr-004333
05:10:14.040 --> 05:10:16.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Let's move on to another topic.

asr-004334
05:10:16.040 --> 05:10:23.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yung payment of the fiscal year 2024 Guaranty Letter arrears.

asr-004335
05:10:23.040 --> 05:10:36.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Nandito sa 2027 HGAB. Special Provision No. 2. Protective Services Program for Individuals and Families in Difficult Circumstances.

asr-004336
05:10:36.040 --> 05:10:39.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Ang sinasabing po rito.

asr-004337
05:10:39.040 --> 05:10:42.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yung Guaranty Letters issued in 2020.

asr-004338
05:10:42.040 --> 05:10:52.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Babayaran sa GAA ng 2027.

asr-004339
05:10:52.040 --> 05:11:01.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Para nag-issue ng cheque na walang pondo ng 2024, popondohan ng GAA ng 2027.

asr-004340
05:11:01.040 --> 05:11:04.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: E tinitingnan namin yung records.

asr-004341
05:11:04.040 --> 05:11:07.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Fully obligated naman yung pondo.

asr-004342
05:11:07.040 --> 05:11:10.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So why would we include this special provision?

asr-004343
05:11:10.040 --> 05:11:13.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: This is Special Provision No. 2.

asr-004344
05:11:13.040 --> 05:11:16.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Na yung payment, ito nakalagay eh.

asr-004345
05:11:16.040 --> 05:11:32.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Provided that the amount appropriated herein shall likewise be used for the payment of arrears to accredited and or partner service providers arising from the issuance of Guaranty Letters in Fiscal Year 2024.

asr-004346
05:11:32.040 --> 05:11:38.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Subject to the availability of funds and compliance with applicable budgeting, accounting, and auditing laws, rules, and regulations.

asr-004347
05:11:38.040 --> 05:11:40.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Subject to the availability of funds and compliance with applicable budgeting, accounting, and auditing laws, rules, and regulations.

asr-004348
05:11:40.040 --> 05:11:47.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: So, if we allow this, sa napunta yung pondo ng 2024?

asr-004349
05:11:47.040 --> 05:11:52.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: At saka bakit sila nag-issue ng Guaranty Letter kung wala namang palang pondo?

asr-004350
05:11:52.040 --> 05:11:55.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Tapos isingilin sa 2027?

asr-004351
05:11:55.040 --> 05:12:02.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At the outset, Mr. President, yun din yung unang nakakagulat sa mga mata natin, bakit may 3-year gap.

asr-004352
05:12:02.040 --> 05:12:06.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pero sabi po ng Department, belatedly na rin nag-file ng money claim.

asr-004353
05:12:06.040 --> 05:12:07.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At the outset, Mr. President, yun din yung unang nakakagulat sa mga mata natin, bakit may 3-year gap.

asr-004354
05:12:07.040 --> 05:12:09.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At the outset, Mr. President, yun din yung unang nakakagulat sa mga mata natin, bakit may 3-year gap.

asr-004355
05:12:09.040 --> 05:12:16.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At nag-sasubmit ng supporting documentation yung mga service providers.

asr-004356
05:12:16.040 --> 05:12:23.040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kaya ngayon lamang ni-request ang special provision na ito sa fiscal year 2027.

asr-004357
05:12:31.040 --> 05:12:36.040
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Pero sa record nga, obligated lahat e.

asr-004358
05:12:36.040 --> 05:12:37.820
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: May pondo for the

asr-004359
05:12:37.820 --> 05:12:38.680
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: guarantee letters.

asr-004360
05:12:38.980 --> 05:12:40.740
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Bakit hindi nabayaran?

asr-004361
05:12:40.880 --> 05:12:43.860
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Anong nangyari dun sa item

asr-004362
05:12:43.860 --> 05:12:44.780
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: of 2024?

asr-004363
05:12:46.320 --> 05:12:46.480
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yeah.

asr-004364
05:12:48.100 --> 05:12:49.180
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 234?

asr-004365
05:12:50.760 --> 05:12:52.100
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: 234 billion?

asr-004366
05:12:55.060 --> 05:12:55.820
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Table.

asr-004367
05:13:01.820 --> 05:13:02.940
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Ito.

