Senator Risa Hontiveros: nangyari. May iba pang mga lugar

asr-004607
05:29:43.320 --> 05:29:45.000
Senator Risa Hontiveros: kung saan ang naging modus

asr-004608
05:29:45.000 --> 05:29:46.620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ay pagkatapos

asr-004609
05:29:46.620 --> 05:29:48.740
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ipay out nung DSWD

asr-004610
05:29:48.740 --> 05:29:51.060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: paymaster, paglabas na

asr-004611
05:29:51.060 --> 05:29:51.800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: nung recipient,

asr-004612
05:29:52.340 --> 05:29:54.460
Senator Risa Hontiveros: lalapitan at haharasin

asr-004613
