Senator Risa Hontiveros: Para? Tatakutin para?

asr-004618
05:30:03.540 --> 05:30:10.400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Tatakutin o haharasin po sila para kumuha ng cut dun sa tinanggap nilang AICS.

asr-004619
05:30:10.560 --> 05:30:11.240
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: E robbery yun.

asr-004620
05:30:13.140 --> 05:30:16.920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kaya po't kinasuha ng department dahil po de facto robbery po yun.

asr-004621
05:30:16.940 --> 05:30:20.020
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Bakit admin charges lang? E robbery yun eh.

asr-004622
05:30:20.760 --> 05:30:24.840
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Bukod po sa admin charges, may criminal charges din pong inihain.

asr-004623
05:30:25.360 --> 05:30:26.440
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Ano yung status na ngayon?

asr-004624
05:30:26.440 --> 05:30:35.480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pareho po yung administrative at saka yung criminal cases ay pending po sa office of the ombudsman, Mr. President.

asr-004625
05:30:37.360 --> 05:30:42.240
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Yeah, we'll just wait for the update kung ano nangyari sa kaso.

asr-004626
05:30:42.240 --> 05:30:47.140
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: Kasi kung ganun kasimple ang kaso, I would like to believe na open and shut case yun eh.

asr-004627
05:30:49.200 --> 05:30:52.260
Senator Panfilo "Ping" M. Lacson: At saka hindi lang admin. Talagang robbery hold up yun eh.

asr-004628
