Senator Risa Hontiveros: Talaga pong huli da po yan, Mr. President.

asr-004629
05:30:55.980 --> 05:31:02.800
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At inaasahan din po ng department na ma-appreciate yung mga kasong yun bilang open and shut cases, Mr. President.

asr-004630
