Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: We recognize Senator Tulfo for his interventions.

asr-004634
05:31:30.160 --> 05:31:38.600
Senate President Sherwin "Win" T. Gatchalian: But before that, let me recognize our former colleague, Senator Francis Tolentino, who's here saying hi to us.

asr-004635
05:31:40.200 --> 05:31:41.740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Thank you, Mr. President.

asr-004636
05:31:42.160 --> 05:31:54.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang una kong katanungan, alam naman natin ito, in fact, during the last hearing sa committee, na bring up ko ito, yung fake PWD's ID.

asr-004637
05:31:54.780 --> 05:32:01.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron bang ginawa o ginagawa yung TSWD para ma-address itong malawakang problema ng ngayon?

asr-004638
05:32:01.620 --> 05:32:06.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kahit na hindi PWD, eh dahil may koneksyon kung saan man, nabibigyan ng PWD.

asr-004639
05:32:06.640 --> 05:32:07.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: In fact, marami akong alam.

asr-004640
05:32:08.240 --> 05:32:09.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mga tatambay-tambay niya.

asr-004641
05:32:09.280 --> 05:32:13.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang lalakas ng katawan at nagbabasketball pa, and yet may PWD ID.

asr-004642
05:32:14.040 --> 05:32:15.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, talamak na ito ngayon.

asr-004643
05:32:15.800 --> 05:32:18.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, is this being addressed by the TSWD?

asr-004644
05:32:19.640 --> 05:32:29.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi billions ang nawawala rito, billions worth of taxes na hindi na ibabayad as a result of dito nga sa mga fake PWD ID.

asr-004645
05:32:29.460 --> 05:32:34.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At ang kawawa dito, yung mga malilit na restaurant, itong palaging tinatamaan.

asr-004646
05:32:39.280 --> 05:32:57.360
Senator Risa Hontiveros: May tatlo pong pinanggagalingan ng problema, Mr. President, at yung tatlong din iyon, posibleng panggagalingan ng solusyon.

asr-004647
05:32:57.360 --> 05:33:08.620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Una pong source ng deception dito sa pag-issue at paggamit ng persons with disability ID ay sa mga doktor.

asr-004648
05:33:09.280 --> 05:33:15.060
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Na maaaring may doktor na kilala, yung magpapanggap na person with disability.

asr-004649
05:33:15.320 --> 05:33:22.140
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At sa doktor na iyon, kukuha ng certification na may disability siya kahit wala.

asr-004650
05:33:26.140 --> 05:33:35.380
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And para tugunan po ito, Mr. President, may administrative order inilabas ang Department of Health in partnership sa DSWD.

asr-004651
05:33:35.700 --> 05:33:38.140
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Tinutukoy po kung anong medical specialist.

asr-004652
05:33:39.280 --> 05:33:47.280
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Medical specialists lamang ang pwedeng mag-issue ng certification of disability para sa taong mag-a-apply para sa person with disability ID.

asr-004653
05:33:47.700 --> 05:33:57.440
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pangalawa po, Mr. President, sa loob po ng local government unit kung saan nakatira yung taong iyon na magpapanggap,

asr-004654
05:33:57.920 --> 05:34:04.920
Senator Risa Hontiveros: minsan may kakilala siya na mag-i-issue ng person with disability ID kahit wala naman talaga siyang disability.

asr-004655
05:34:07.320 --> 05:34:08.360
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And pangatlo,

asr-004656
05:34:09.280 --> 05:34:14.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ikaugnay po, Mr. President, ng niro-rollout na unified ID system.

asr-004657
05:34:14.860 --> 05:34:25.180
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Nasa ngayon po ang balita sa DSWD, 82% na pong na-rollout among local government units.

asr-004664
05:34:56.860 --> 05:35:09.260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And may ongoing process na ngayon, Mr. President, para ma-mandate ang DSWD bilang isa sa mga agencies na pwedeng mag-i-issue nitong unified ID system.

asr-004665
05:35:09.280 --> 05:35:13.440
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Doon sa mga totoong persons with disability.

asr-004666
05:35:13.720 --> 05:35:20.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Batay sa live database na ginagamit ng gobyerno para dito sa unified ID system, Mr. President.

asr-004667
05:35:26.260 --> 05:35:27.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay.

asr-004668
05:35:27.860 --> 05:35:35.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi, Mr. President, ayon sa DOJ, 5.6 million PWD IDs na fake kumakalat ngayon.

asr-004669
05:35:35.560 --> 05:35:39.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So paano natin ma-resolve ba itong issue na ito?

asr-004670
05:35:39.280 --> 05:36:09.260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Thank you very much.

asr-004671
05:36:09.280 --> 05:36:17.520
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung isang solusyon na sinusulong po ng DSWD, Mr. President,

asr-004672
05:36:17.700 --> 05:36:24.480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ay yung 5.6 million na inulat ng DOJ na fake pala na persons with disability IDs,

asr-004673
05:36:24.900 --> 05:36:30.580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: lahat po yan ay hindi nakatuntong doon sa live database na binabanggit ng DSWD.

asr-004674
05:36:30.580 --> 05:36:39.000
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So gumagawa po sila ng technological na paraan na yung mga establishments

asr-004675
05:36:39.000 --> 05:36:44.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na hihingian ng persons with disability discount

asr-004676
05:36:44.600 --> 05:36:48.840
Senator Risa Hontiveros: gamit yung fake pala na persons with disability IDs na yun,

asr-004677
05:36:49.420 --> 05:36:51.100
Senator Risa Hontiveros: hindi po sila makaka-access.

asr-004678
05:36:51.300 --> 05:36:57.880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Dahil lahat ng mga establishmentong iyon ay in-encourage ng department

asr-004679
05:36:57.880 --> 05:37:06.220
Senator Risa Hontiveros: gamitin yung live database para i-validate sa pamamagitan ng QR code lamang

asr-004680
05:37:06.220 --> 05:37:08.980
Senator Risa Hontiveros: makaka-access ang tunay na persons.

asr-004681
05:37:09.000 --> 05:37:18.200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So ngayon kasi karamihan sa mga fake PWD IDs ay yung nasa plastic laminated lang.

asr-004682
05:37:18.680 --> 05:37:20.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So pag nag-present sila nun sa isang restaurant,

asr-004683
05:37:20.920 --> 05:37:26.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: so yung mga restaurant meron na silang database na pag pinindot nila yung pangalan ng tao,

asr-004684
05:37:27.020 --> 05:37:28.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: so malalamang kung fake o hindi yun.

asr-004685
05:37:29.080 --> 05:37:30.140
Senator Risa Hontiveros: That's right, Mr. President.

asr-004686
05:37:30.380 --> 05:37:35.320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Isa-scan lamang, then yun yung mabavalidate on the live database

asr-004687
05:37:35.320 --> 05:37:38.980
Senator Risa Hontiveros: kung tunay na ID ito ng totoong person with disability.

asr-004688
05:37:39.000 --> 05:37:41.420
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Na magiging karapat-dapat sa mga beneficiary.

asr-004689
05:37:41.420 --> 05:37:42.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Okay, may problema tayo dyan.

asr-004690
05:37:42.440 --> 05:37:47.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi like I said earlier, marami sa mga tao na nakuha ng fake PWD IDs

asr-004691
05:37:47.140 --> 05:37:52.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: dahil may kasubat na doktor or naging pabaya yung taga-LGU

asr-004692
05:37:52.980 --> 05:37:57.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na basta't pirma ng pirma dahil may koneksyon, kumpare, kumare, kapitbahay, etc.

asr-004693
05:37:58.000 --> 05:37:59.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kaya binibigyan nalang, pinapasa agad.

asr-004694
05:38:00.060 --> 05:38:06.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So how do we address these 5.6 million of fake PWD IDs?

asr-004695
05:38:06.300 --> 05:38:08.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So sila ba ilalagay pa sa database or?

asr-004696
05:38:09.000 --> 05:38:17.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eh, lahat na may PWD IDs kailang mag-re-apply or magpadala ng mga medical certificate

asr-004697
05:38:17.980 --> 05:38:21.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: para masiguro talagang karapat-dapat sila.

asr-004698
05:38:28.800 --> 05:38:35.360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi ang nawawala pala, 88.2 billion pesos every year sa mga unpaid taxes.

asr-004699
05:38:35.360 --> 05:38:38.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi na babayaran kasi ayun, nalulugi yung mga restaurant.

asr-004700
05:38:39.000 --> 05:38:40.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hotel, etc.

asr-004701
05:38:41.120 --> 05:38:44.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Eh, syempre, nabibigyan sila ng 20% discount na hindi dapat.

asr-004702
05:38:44.780 --> 05:38:50.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So malaking kalugyan ito in taxes, in the form of taxes, dahil dito sa mga fake PWD IDs.

asr-004703
05:38:51.420 --> 05:38:52.740
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yes, Mr. President.

asr-004704
05:38:53.440 --> 05:39:00.000
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kailangang i-revise yung IRR para nga maging issuing body ang DSWD

asr-004705
05:39:00.000 --> 05:39:03.400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: para sa mga tunay na persons with disability IDs

asr-004706
05:39:03.400 --> 05:39:08.980
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na mapapatunayan dun sa live database at yung paggamit ng mga QR codes.

asr-004707
05:39:09.000 --> 05:39:15.780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: ng mga establisimiento para maiabot yung mga benepisyon sa mga tunay na persons with disabilities

asr-004708
05:39:15.780 --> 05:39:19.020
Senator Risa Hontiveros: na may hawak ng genuine na persons with disability ID.

asr-004709
05:39:19.400 --> 05:39:28.020
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Mangangailangan po, Mr. President, na mag, by way of validation, re-application, pero online lamang, Mr. President.

asr-004710
05:39:28.180 --> 05:39:37.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Opo, para dun sa mga doktor na malungkot man sabihin, pero nag-i-issue ng certification kahit walang disability talaga yung tao.

asr-004711
05:39:37.880 --> 05:39:38.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Kaya po may...

asr-004712
05:39:39.000 --> 05:39:43.620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: In-issue ang order, ang administrative order, ang DOH,

asr-004713
05:39:43.880 --> 05:39:49.940
Senator Risa Hontiveros: para tukuyin alin lamang mga specialization ng mga doktorang authorized mag-issue ng ganyang classing certificate.

asr-004714
05:39:49.940 --> 05:39:56.200
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Sa mga LGU na may tauhan doon na nag-i-issue din ng fake ID.

asr-004715
05:39:57.040 --> 05:40:03.440
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So may mga DILG ay kailangan disiplinahin yung mga taong iyon.

asr-004716
05:40:03.720 --> 05:40:08.820
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Meron ding preliminary talks between NBI at saka yung National Commission.

asr-004717
05:40:09.000 --> 05:40:10.640
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yung Disability Affairs, Mr. President.

asr-004718
05:40:11.020 --> 05:40:18.020
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Para tugunan at least itong tatlong sources ng pecking persons with disability IDs.

asr-004719
05:40:18.140 --> 05:40:19.880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Okay, gusto ko lang maklaro, Mr. President.

asr-004720
05:40:20.320 --> 05:40:26.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So yung isa doon, re-application, and para magkaroon ng unified PWD ID system, so QR code na lang.

asr-004721
05:40:27.200 --> 05:40:35.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So itong mga lahat ng PWD, mag-re-apply online, and then bibigyan sila ng QR code card.

asr-004722
05:40:35.580 --> 05:40:37.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At saka malalagyan sila sa system.

asr-004723
05:40:37.920 --> 05:40:38.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Para yung mga fake.

asr-004724
05:40:39.000 --> 05:40:40.360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mamubura na, matatanggal.

asr-004725
05:40:40.480 --> 05:40:45.100
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And actually, Mr. President, wala na pong card. QR code na lang. So digital po.

asr-004726
05:40:45.300 --> 05:40:45.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Digital.

asr-004727
05:40:45.900 --> 05:40:48.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: All right. Sige, very good. Thank you.

asr-004728
05:40:48.820 --> 05:40:51.340
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: In fact, nag-start ata yan, September 2025, ano?

asr-004729
05:40:53.080 --> 05:40:55.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: So, and it's ongoing?

asr-004730
